(493082, 48324, 7350, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  The star filter effects on the earrings don''t really have much to do with the shot itself, but somehow I think they give it the mood it needs.  9.</td>', 'Wonderful.  The star filter effects on the earrings don''t really have much to do with the shot itself, but somehow I think they give it the mood it needs.  9.', '2003-11-24 00:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
