(493469, 48202, 10785, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. An excellent idea for the challenge. I like the composition of this photo. The hands are framed well and the focus is on the main subject. Good DOF brings your attention to the action. I think this photo is over saturated, over contrasted and over sharpened. The light is focused on the womans fingertip and should be on the ring.<br/> <br/>I hope my comments were helpful and not condescending.</td>', 'I really like this shot. An excellent idea for the challenge. I like the composition of this photo. The hands are framed well and the focus is on the main subject. Good DOF brings your attention to the action. I think this photo is over saturated, over contrasted and over sharpened. The light is focused on the womans fingertip and should be on the ring. I hope my comments were helpful and not condescending.', '2003-11-24 10:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(493471, 48259, 10785, '<td valign="top">The obligatory bathtub shot. Every child has one and as the child ages, it usually moves from the surprise challenge to the nightmare file! My mom vows to bring out my tub shot when I get married. That''s why I remain single! lol!</td>', 'The obligatory bathtub shot. Every child has one and as the child ages, it usually moves from the surprise challenge to the nightmare file! My mom vows to bring out my tub shot when I get married. That''s why I remain single! lol!', '2003-11-24 10:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(493474, 48213, 10785, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been so close to an outie in my life...</td>', 'I''ve never been so close to an outie in my life...', '2003-11-24 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(493486, 48295, 13957, '<td valign="top">BWahahahahahaha...  Fantastic.... A+</td>', 'BWahahahahahaha...  Fantastic.... A+', '2003-11-24 11:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(493488, 47613, 7543, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit over sharpened. The outline of the subject (his shoulders) show clear results of over sharpening.</td>', 'It seems a bit over sharpened. The outline of the subject (his shoulders) show clear results of over sharpening.', '2003-11-24 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(493510, 48199, 7543, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture - 10! (Next best image got an 8) Not that it bothers me, but the subjects shirt looks like this is splash no. 2. Would imagine that this kind of shot would need a few go''s. Nice job on the background. Hope you win.</td>', 'Excellent capture - 10! (Next best image got an 8) Not that it bothers me, but the subjects shirt looks like this is splash no. 2. Would imagine that this kind of shot would need a few go''s. Nice job on the background. Hope you win.', '2003-11-24 11:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(493529, 48234, 12061, '<td valign="top">funny! Made me laugh :) <br/>Some comments, that faint horizontal line in the center is a minor distraction<br/>the color tones of the hand would look nice dulled a little, maybe turn down the red saturation ;) <br/>I don''t like how the border are a different thickness on the top and sides. <br/>overall, great shot!<br/></td>', 'funny! Made me laugh :) Some comments, that faint horizontal line in the center is a minor distractionthe color tones of the hand would look nice dulled a little, maybe turn down the red saturation ;) I don''t like how the border are a different thickness on the top and sides. overall, great shot!', '2003-11-24 11:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(493531, 48074, 12061, '<td valign="top">too much negative space at the top<br/>focus is excellent<br/>nice mixture of colors<br/>interesting shot!</td>', 'too much negative space at the topfocus is excellentnice mixture of colorsinteresting shot!', '2003-11-24 11:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(493564, 48234, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute! Unusual composition and viewpoint. Somewhat abstract. I like the whimsical nature of it.</td>', 'Cute! Unusual composition and viewpoint. Somewhat abstract. I like the whimsical nature of it.', '2003-11-24 12:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(493566, 48202, 3087, '<td valign="top">Curiously harsh treatment of the image (high contrast, hard black tones) considering the nature of the event but I do like it.</td>', 'Curiously harsh treatment of the image (high contrast, hard black tones) considering the nature of the event but I do like it.', '2003-11-24 12:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(493567, 47975, 3087, '<td valign="top">Eeeuw! Definite shock value and I like the use of the inside rim of the plate to provide compositional balance, and the plate surface, to provide texture.</td>', 'Eeeuw! Definite shock value and I like the use of the inside rim of the plate to provide compositional balance, and the plate surface, to provide texture.', '2003-11-24 12:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(493569, 48199, 3087, '<td valign="top">The motion of the water is beautifully captured and the long snaking curve of it makes for quite a dynamic composition. Poor soul!</td>', 'The motion of the water is beautifully captured and the long snaking curve of it makes for quite a dynamic composition. Poor soul!', '2003-11-24 12:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(493572, 48213, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely minimalist photo with a superbly balanced composition. The simplicity is a very strong tool.</td>', 'A lovely minimalist photo with a superbly balanced composition. The simplicity is a very strong tool.', '2003-11-24 12:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(493574, 47791, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured moment in time! Colours and shapes visually appealing.</td>', 'Nicely captured moment in time! Colours and shapes visually appealing.', '2003-11-24 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(493582, 48199, 13576, '<td valign="top">I have been staring at this photo and it''s driving me nuts.<br/>1st off let me say, this is an excellent capture. Lighting is good, white balance, focus, the whole 9 yards. Wonderful.<br/>Now, here is what I cannot seem to figure out. You have a near complete black background. This does not look like harsh flash, and I KNOW you where not tossing water buckets around your studio... Please share how you got such rich true color.<br/>Lastly, I see from his hair that this was most likely not staged. Good Job.<br/></td>', 'I have been staring at this photo and it''s driving me nuts.1st off let me say, this is an excellent capture. Lighting is good, white balance, focus, the whole 9 yards. Wonderful.Now, here is what I cannot seem to figure out. You have a near complete black background. This does not look like harsh flash, and I KNOW you where not tossing water buckets around your studio... Please share how you got such rich true color.Lastly, I see from his hair that this was most likely not staged. Good Job.', '2003-11-24 13:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(493584, 48161, 13576, '<td valign="top">Great focus! What an adorable shot. The expressions are priceless. <br/>A bit overexposed, but I still love the surprise element. <br/></td>', 'Great focus! What an adorable shot. The expressions are priceless. A bit overexposed, but I still love the surprise element. ', '2003-11-24 13:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(493585, 48074, 13576, '<td valign="top">Is that your pet crow?<br/>The blurred background works here. It helps to keep the focus on what is goin on in the picture. <br/>Good Job.</td>', 'Is that your pet crow?The blurred background works here. It helps to keep the focus on what is goin on in the picture. Good Job.', '2003-11-24 13:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(493587, 48316, 13576, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft. A little grainy. The shadows are a bit distacting to me.  Really nice photo.<br/></td>', 'Focus is a little soft. A little grainy. The shadows are a bit distacting to me.  Really nice photo.', '2003-11-24 13:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(493610, 48265, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice clear picture. I think the mouse should have looked towards the camera. Maybe include a hand and a spoon to express the surprise element even stronger ? 7</td>', 'Nice clear picture. I think the mouse should have looked towards the camera. Maybe include a hand and a spoon to express the surprise element even stronger ? 7', '2003-11-24 13:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(493611, 48316, 11895, '<td valign="top">great idea, would have rated higher with me if it was in color</td>', 'great idea, would have rated higher with me if it was in color', '2003-11-24 13:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(493613, 48163, 4008, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well taken. The face could have expressed some more surprise.</td>', 'Good idea and well taken. The face could have expressed some more surprise.', '2003-11-24 13:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(493614, 48295, 4008, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what Nair is but I guess it is not a shampoo ? The image (at least the bottle) does not seem to be totally sharp. Could have cropped a bit of the left side of the image.</td>', 'I don''t know what Nair is but I guess it is not a shampoo ? The image (at least the bottle) does not seem to be totally sharp. Could have cropped a bit of the left side of the image.', '2003-11-24 13:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(493683, 48202, 10643, '<td valign="top">I like the stark black &amp; white of this, but I wish the setup was better. This is a wedding ring, not an engagement ring, so it''s not really what would be used for a proposal, and it''s being placed on a right hand, not a left hand like an engagement ring would be. Those minor things throw off the "surprise" story and make this look like someone putting a ring on their own opposite hand.</td>', 'I like the stark black & white of this, but I wish the setup was better. This is a wedding ring, not an engagement ring, so it''s not really what would be used for a proposal, and it''s being placed on a right hand, not a left hand like an engagement ring would be. Those minor things throw off the "surprise" story and make this look like someone putting a ring on their own opposite hand.', '2003-11-24 15:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(493684, 48304, 1280, '<td valign="top">Adirondacks?</td>', 'Adirondacks?', '2003-11-24 15:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(493686, 48259, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cute...very cute!</td>', 'Cute...very cute!', '2003-11-24 15:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(493688, 48005, 1280, '<td valign="top">Appears to be over-exposed, causing blown out spots. Idea is a good one.</td>', 'Appears to be over-exposed, causing blown out spots. Idea is a good one.', '2003-11-24 15:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(493721, 48308, 10151, '<td valign="top">...of....<br/> <br/>What did she get caught doing???  Other than that the photo is great...a little motion blur and red-eye, but those can be forgiven do to the candid nature of the shot. 6</td>', '...of.... What did she get caught doing???  Other than that the photo is great...a little motion blur and red-eye, but those can be forgiven do to the candid nature of the shot. 6', '2003-11-24 16:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(493722, 48144, 13919, '<td valign="top">This shot has captured true surprise. Exactly what the comp requested. Well done</td>', 'This shot has captured true surprise. Exactly what the comp requested. Well done', '2003-11-24 16:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(493741, 48163, 327, '<td valign="top">I know this young man..both of them. :) Love the shot. This would of been good on his nose too. Maybe color would of been more stunning with the butterfly? I do think his expression is wonderful here and your lighting is just great.</td>', 'I know this young man..both of them. :) Love the shot. This would of been good on his nose too. Maybe color would of been more stunning with the butterfly? I do think his expression is wonderful here and your lighting is just great.', '2003-11-24 16:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(493745, 48240, 327, '<td valign="top">Few over sharpened areas. [teeth] It is a cute shot.</td>', 'Few over sharpened areas. [teeth] It is a cute shot.', '2003-11-24 17:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(493747, 48247, 327, '<td valign="top">The tones and focus is very nice. Good lens you have. I just feel the overall shot looks a bit too staged or snap shot like. I don''t dislike your shot at all just tossing out some random thoughts.</td>', 'The tones and focus is very nice. Good lens you have. I just feel the overall shot looks a bit too staged or snap shot like. I don''t dislike your shot at all just tossing out some random thoughts.', '2003-11-24 17:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(493749, 48307, 327, '<td valign="top">The light is very strong and this has a look of over exposed to me. I get the idea and know the joke. Maybe if we''d seen her face? Nice try and the focus is very good.</td>', 'The light is very strong and this has a look of over exposed to me. I get the idea and know the joke. Maybe if we''d seen her face? Nice try and the focus is very good.', '2003-11-24 17:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(493750, 48202, 327, '<td valign="top">I''ll tell ya this shot has appeal, and I really don''t dislike it. What I don''t like is that both hands look too masculine. Please don''t take offense, and also note I don''t have long sculptured nails either. I will say your lighting is very good as are the tones.</td>', 'I''ll tell ya this shot has appeal, and I really don''t dislike it. What I don''t like is that both hands look too masculine. Please don''t take offense, and also note I don''t have long sculptured nails either. I will say your lighting is very good as are the tones.', '2003-11-24 17:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(493753, 48117, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but I don''t really see surprise here. Her room is sure cute. Good focus and dof.</td>', 'Cute idea but I don''t really see surprise here. Her room is sure cute. Good focus and dof.', '2003-11-24 17:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(493754, 48005, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition and good idea. The light is way to harsh and it just fries the hand. The glass has visible finger prints and they are a distraction. Your focus is nice and the idea was a good one.</td>', 'Good composition and good idea. The light is way to harsh and it just fries the hand. The glass has visible finger prints and they are a distraction. Your focus is nice and the idea was a good one.', '2003-11-24 17:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(493755, 48215, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute puppy but this really doesn''t say surprise to me.</td>', 'Cute puppy but this really doesn''t say surprise to me.', '2003-11-24 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(493756, 47437, 327, '<td valign="top">Party? She sure has a look of glee on her face.</td>', 'Party? She sure has a look of glee on her face.', '2003-11-24 17:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(493757, 48284, 327, '<td valign="top">Good idea and good shot. Maybe a bit over sharpened here and there. The idea is super.</td>', 'Good idea and good shot. Maybe a bit over sharpened here and there. The idea is super.', '2003-11-24 17:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(493759, 48173, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this, like the idea. I don''t like the lack of contrast. Maybe the orange in the pear? Anyway the light is strong on the right and burns out the detail in the area we really need to see the most. Make sense? I hope so. Again good idea, creative.</td>', 'I like this, like the idea. I don''t like the lack of contrast. Maybe the orange in the pear? Anyway the light is strong on the right and burns out the detail in the area we really need to see the most. Make sense? I hope so. Again good idea, creative.', '2003-11-24 17:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(493760, 48199, 12061, '<td valign="top">Supurb capture!</td>', 'Supurb capture!', '2003-11-24 17:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(493761, 48138, 12061, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus, colors and lighting! A very professional look to it. I really like this shot, its my favourite one so far. Excellent work! I would expect to see it in the top 3 :)<br/></td>', 'Wonderful focus, colors and lighting! A very professional look to it. I really like this shot, its my favourite one so far. Excellent work! I would expect to see it in the top 3 :)', '2003-11-24 17:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(493762, 48281, 4153, '<td valign="top">Poor John</td>', 'Poor John', '2003-11-24 17:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(493763, 48308, 327, '<td valign="top">Little cutie pie. Love the lace and her expression. Still this has a look of guilt and not surprise to me.</td>', 'Little cutie pie. Love the lace and her expression. Still this has a look of guilt and not surprise to me.', '2003-11-24 17:15:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(493764, 48265, 327, '<td valign="top">Too bad he looking the other way. Good colors, light and good idea. Nice shot. I hope you do well in the challenge.</td>', 'Too bad he looking the other way. Good colors, light and good idea. Nice shot. I hope you do well in the challenge.', '2003-11-24 17:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(493765, 48199, 327, '<td valign="top">I hope you only had to do this once!! :)</td>', 'I hope you only had to do this once!! :)', '2003-11-24 17:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(493766, 47975, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL fun idea. I like this. Maybe a blue eye? Good job.</td>', 'LOL fun idea. I like this. Maybe a blue eye? Good job.', '2003-11-24 17:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(493771, 48323, 327, '<td valign="top">Now why didn''t I think of that!!! Wonderful idea. Very good work!!!!!! That is surprise. :) Way to go!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Now why didn''t I think of that!!! Wonderful idea. Very good work!!!!!! That is surprise. :) Way to go!!!!!!!!!!', '2003-11-24 17:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(493774, 48295, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and creative thinking. Wow that would be a nightmare.</td>', 'Cute idea and creative thinking. Wow that would be a nightmare.', '2003-11-24 17:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(493776, 48281, 327, '<td valign="top">I guess that happens....keeping it in the family. lol. Good idea for the challenge. Not too crazy for the material this is sitting on and the focus is somewhat soft with harsh light. I do like the composition.</td>', 'I guess that happens....keeping it in the family. lol. Good idea for the challenge. Not too crazy for the material this is sitting on and the focus is somewhat soft with harsh light. I do like the composition.', '2003-11-24 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(493777, 48141, 327, '<td valign="top">Sinister little wooden man!!!!! lol Cool how you did the light. Focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Sinister little wooden man!!!!! lol Cool how you did the light. Focus is a bit soft.', '2003-11-24 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(493778, 48302, 327, '<td valign="top">Handsome group of guys with good expressions.</td>', 'Handsome group of guys with good expressions.', '2003-11-24 17:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(493779, 48316, 327, '<td valign="top">Funny shot, and fun idea. I like it.</td>', 'Funny shot, and fun idea. I like it.', '2003-11-24 17:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(493784, 48259, 327, '<td valign="top">What a great face! Lovely blue eyes.</td>', 'What a great face! Lovely blue eyes.', '2003-11-24 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(493786, 48207, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the reference to ''indians'' here?</td>', 'Not sure I get the reference to ''indians'' here?', '2003-11-24 17:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(493787, 48318, 7889, '<td valign="top">This was the only photo in the whole of the challenege that captured suprise, imho. Its a great shot, colour is very good, 8</td>', 'This was the only photo in the whole of the challenege that captured suprise, imho. Its a great shot, colour is very good, 8', '2003-11-24 17:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(493788, 48138, 327, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and wonderful colors. Good shooting.</td>', 'Clever idea and wonderful colors. Good shooting.', '2003-11-24 17:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(493790, 48324, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cute subject.  I love her smile and her hand coming up to take his away.  I''d crop a tiny bit at the top to get rid of that white bit.  Whish the hands were sharp.  The sparkle on the earing make it look like a jewelry ad - eye catching, but a bit distracting when the shot is about the expression on her face.</td>', 'Cute subject.  I love her smile and her hand coming up to take his away.  I''d crop a tiny bit at the top to get rid of that white bit.  Whish the hands were sharp.  The sparkle on the earing make it look like a jewelry ad - eye catching, but a bit distracting when the shot is about the expression on her face.', '2003-11-24 17:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(493794, 48240, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how you have the shower curtain sweeping down from the corner, helps guide our eye anchor the subjects in the all white background.  It is a funny idea, and you had a great model.  wish she and the gator were sharper.</td>', 'I like how you have the shower curtain sweeping down from the corner, helps guide our eye anchor the subjects in the all white background.  It is a funny idea, and you had a great model.  wish she and the gator were sharper.', '2003-11-24 17:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(493798, 48202, 7628, '<td valign="top">The fingers are almost as metalic as the ring at this high contrast.   You''ve got some great detail in the finger prints on the left hand.  I''d think a larger DOF would work better, bringing the ring finger into focus.  While this can be a surprising moment, I don''t feel the surprise looking at the hands...</td>', 'The fingers are almost as metalic as the ring at this high contrast.   You''ve got some great detail in the finger prints on the left hand.  I''d think a larger DOF would work better, bringing the ring finger into focus.  While this can be a surprising moment, I don''t feel the surprise looking at the hands...', '2003-11-24 17:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(493810, 48281, 7628, '<td valign="top">Yes, that would be quite a surprise!  I''d like to see the look on John''s face, actually that is missing, or a gesture of his hand as he drops the phone.  This pictures is very static for a surprise.  Having the ring next to the phone is a nice touch tho''</td>', 'Yes, that would be quite a surprise!  I''d like to see the look on John''s face, actually that is missing, or a gesture of his hand as he drops the phone.  This pictures is very static for a surprise.  Having the ring next to the phone is a nice touch tho''', '2003-11-24 17:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(493815, 48316, 10047, '<td valign="top">Great expression, attractive model, well done photo. The forearm might be a little overexposed.</td>', 'Great expression, attractive model, well done photo. The forearm might be a little overexposed.', '2003-11-24 17:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(493817, 48295, 7628, '<td valign="top">Oh! My! What a nightmare!  I look at this and cringe - clever idea.  If you could use a larger DOF the nair and her face would be in focus.</td>', 'Oh! My! What a nightmare!  I look at this and cringe - clever idea.  If you could use a larger DOF the nair and her face would be in focus.', '2003-11-24 17:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(493818, 48138, 8753, '<td valign="top">Great colours</td>', 'Great colours', '2003-11-24 17:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(493819, 48141, 8753, '<td valign="top">Nice idea using the wooden poser man, what did you use for the light?</td>', 'Nice idea using the wooden poser man, what did you use for the light?', '2003-11-24 17:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(493821, 48144, 10047, '<td valign="top">Genuine expression, cute model, and an awesome photo. Like the clarity and crispness. Would have like to seen what caused the expression.</td>', 'Genuine expression, cute model, and an awesome photo. Like the clarity and crispness. Would have like to seen what caused the expression.', '2003-11-24 17:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(493822, 48302, 8753, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and tones of black and white but it does look quite posed</td>', 'Nice composition and tones of black and white but it does look quite posed', '2003-11-24 17:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(493824, 48265, 8753, '<td valign="top">Hehe, cute... that would be quite a surprise!</td>', 'Hehe, cute... that would be quite a surprise!', '2003-11-24 17:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(493825, 48314, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve included the mouth just on the side, wish it were sharper.  You''ve carefully set up the letter and the black backdrop, and given thought to how the arm and hand should be connected logically to the face, but the lighting could be better, this is all so gray.</td>', 'I like how you''ve included the mouth just on the side, wish it were sharper.  You''ve carefully set up the letter and the black backdrop, and given thought to how the arm and hand should be connected logically to the face, but the lighting could be better, this is all so gray.', '2003-11-24 17:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(493826, 48005, 8753, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and I like hte composition but I feel it''s a little overexposed</td>', 'Nice idea and I like hte composition but I feel it''s a little overexposed', '2003-11-24 17:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(493828, 48312, 10047, '<td valign="top">Great expression, and a well done photo. One of the few photos in the challenge where you can see the expression and what caused it. Nice tonsils also.</td>', 'Great expression, and a well done photo. One of the few photos in the challenge where you can see the expression and what caused it. Nice tonsils also.', '2003-11-24 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(493829, 48205, 8753, '<td valign="top">nice composition but i don''t quite understand how this meets the challenge, sorry</td>', 'nice composition but i don''t quite understand how this meets the challenge, sorry', '2003-11-24 18:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(493830, 48318, 10047, '<td valign="top">Grest expression, and a nice model. Would have like to see the score in the background, but the title helps it along. Maybe too much make-up, but thats a personal peeve.</td>', 'Grest expression, and a nice model. Would have like to see the score in the background, but the title helps it along. Maybe too much make-up, but thats a personal peeve.', '2003-11-24 18:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(493831, 48313, 7628, '<td valign="top">Caught in the glare of the headlights?  It is a bit hard to understand whats going on.  If we could see more of the face maybe.  I see the car is facing him, but it doesn''t seem to be moving.  I feel more menace from the man because I can;t see his face.  Does that make any sense?</td>', 'Caught in the glare of the headlights?  It is a bit hard to understand whats going on.  If we could see more of the face maybe.  I see the car is facing him, but it doesn''t seem to be moving.  I feel more menace from the man because I can;t see his face.  Does that make any sense?', '2003-11-24 18:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(493833, 48220, 8753, '<td valign="top">Pretty lighting</td>', 'Pretty lighting', '2003-11-24 18:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(493835, 48314, 8753, '<td valign="top">I like how such a small part of the face showing allows so much emotion to be conveyed</td>', 'I like how such a small part of the face showing allows so much emotion to be conveyed', '2003-11-24 18:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(493837, 48284, 10047, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea. Wish I''d thought of it. It looks like the picture pixelated a little.</td>', 'Awesome idea. Wish I''d thought of it. It looks like the picture pixelated a little.', '2003-11-24 18:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(493838, 48259, 7628, '<td valign="top">love the look on the face, "It wasn''t bad enough that you had to give me. a bath?  You had to take pictures too??"  light from the flash is very directional, gives that harsh shadow, the background is a bit jumbled and distracting.</td>', 'love the look on the face, "It wasn''t bad enough that you had to give me. a bath?  You had to take pictures too??"  light from the flash is very directional, gives that harsh shadow, the background is a bit jumbled and distracting.', '2003-11-24 18:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(493840, 48240, 10047, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little soft on the focus and a little pixelation.</td>', 'Maybe a little soft on the focus and a little pixelation.', '2003-11-24 18:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(493842, 48247, 7628, '<td valign="top">The blur of motion on the left helps us to feel the surprise, the bold patterns and tones of the girl on the right''s cothes stand out well against the white.  The stairs and the door are distracting.</td>', 'The blur of motion on the left helps us to feel the surprise, the bold patterns and tones of the girl on the right''s cothes stand out well against the white.  The stairs and the door are distracting.', '2003-11-24 18:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(493844, 48177, 10047, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo, but the squirrel looks more curious than surprised.</td>', 'Awesome photo, but the squirrel looks more curious than surprised.', '2003-11-24 18:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(493849, 47437, 7628, '<td valign="top">I guess you had to be there.  She does look pleased, and it looks like a nice time between friends, but the foreground and background are cluttered and distracting and the red package draws our eyes away from her face which should be getting the attention.</td>', 'I guess you had to be there.  She does look pleased, and it looks like a nice time between friends, but the foreground and background are cluttered and distracting and the red package draws our eyes away from her face which should be getting the attention.', '2003-11-24 18:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(493851, 48250, 10047, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t say surprise to me. I would have tried a tighter crop on the sides. Too many things competing for attention.</td>', 'Doesn''t say surprise to me. I would have tried a tighter crop on the sides. Too many things competing for attention.', '2003-11-24 18:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(493853, 48133, 7628, '<td valign="top">Yes, that would be a shock, more for the giver than the receiver.  The black velvet box shows up well against the hand.  I''d like to see more contrast between the hand and the background.  Wish the hand was in focus.  Wish the gesture implied more surprise, maybe he could be dropping the box?  Or if there was a mirror in the back, we could see the look on herr face?</td>', 'Yes, that would be a shock, more for the giver than the receiver.  The black velvet box shows up well against the hand.  I''d like to see more contrast between the hand and the background.  Wish the hand was in focus.  Wish the gesture implied more surprise, maybe he could be dropping the box?  Or if there was a mirror in the back, we could see the look on herr face?', '2003-11-24 18:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(493854, 48086, 10047, '<td valign="top">The photo is well done and I like the props, but it doesn''t say Surprise to me.</td>', 'The photo is well done and I like the props, but it doesn''t say Surprise to me.', '2003-11-24 18:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(493858, 48126, 7628, '<td valign="top">cookie monster?  The light is too bright, and I wish there was better focus.  I''d be upset if my cookies got eaten (not by me...) but I''d like to see the look on the persons face.</td>', 'cookie monster?  The light is too bright, and I wish there was better focus.  I''d be upset if my cookies got eaten (not by me...) but I''d like to see the look on the persons face.', '2003-11-24 18:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(493863, 48265, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cute and funny.  Wish the mouse were facing the camera, he does look pretty mystfied from what I can see.  Those are a great set of whiskers - wish we could see them better against the background - highlight them with lighting or use a dark background?</td>', 'Cute and funny.  Wish the mouse were facing the camera, he does look pretty mystfied from what I can see.  Those are a great set of whiskers - wish we could see them better against the background - highlight them with lighting or use a dark background?', '2003-11-24 18:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(493869, 48203, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like that we can see both the ring and the look on her face, and even the gesture of her hands.  The focus could be better and the scene should be less flatly lit.</td>', 'I like that we can see both the ring and the look on her face, and even the gesture of her hands.  The focus could be better and the scene should be less flatly lit.', '2003-11-24 18:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(493874, 48005, 7628, '<td valign="top">Neat idea - the ing is in the glass, I like how it has tilted in her hand as if she is just noticing.  The lighting is almost completely blown out on the hand - we can;t see any details..and the light is glaring off the fingerprints on the glass.  It is a good idea and a nice composition, but need better preparation befoer shooting.</td>', 'Neat idea - the ing is in the glass, I like how it has tilted in her hand as if she is just noticing.  The lighting is almost completely blown out on the hand - we can;t see any details..and the light is glaring off the fingerprints on the glass.  It is a good idea and a nice composition, but need better preparation befoer shooting.', '2003-11-24 18:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(493882, 48213, 7628, '<td valign="top">Tickles?  Pretty cute belly with that rim of pants showing.  I like the sepia tone - warm and flesh-like.  Wish the fingernail was clean, and the texture of the skin is a bit flat.  Still nicely done, show thought.</td>', 'Tickles?  Pretty cute belly with that rim of pants showing.  I like the sepia tone - warm and flesh-like.  Wish the fingernail was clean, and the texture of the skin is a bit flat.  Still nicely done, show thought.', '2003-11-24 18:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(493883, 48278, 7628, '<td valign="top">Ouch.  Hard to get a sense of what is up and down, although I''m sure that is how this climber feels.  Everything is shaken.  If the rock were sharp, and the climber swingin all over at least we''d have a point of reference.</td>', 'Ouch.  Hard to get a sense of what is up and down, although I''m sure that is how this climber feels.  Everything is shaken.  If the rock were sharp, and the climber swingin all over at least we''d have a point of reference.', '2003-11-24 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(493886, 47791, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun idea.  I like the blurr of other baloons in the background.  Wish the yellow one and the fingers were more in focus.</td>', 'Fun idea.  I like the blurr of other baloons in the background.  Wish the yellow one and the fingers were more in focus.', '2003-11-24 18:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(493889, 48220, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very visually poetic.  The illumination of the bow in nice.  Wish the wrapping were neater, and the book (?) to the left draws our attention away.  Maybe a bit o light fro the side would help fill out the box, define its shape.  Also I wish the box were aligned better with the edge o the picture, or completely at an angle to it.</td>', 'Very visually poetic.  The illumination of the bow in nice.  Wish the wrapping were neater, and the book (?) to the left draws our attention away.  Maybe a bit o light fro the side would help fill out the box, define its shape.  Also I wish the box were aligned better with the edge o the picture, or completely at an angle to it.', '2003-11-24 18:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(493893, 48316, 7628, '<td valign="top">Adorable set up!  Geat expressionon both faces!  I wish the lighting had been done such that there would be no shadows or sharp shadows.  Maybe crop in from top and bottom a bit.</td>', 'Adorable set up!  Geat expressionon both faces!  I wish the lighting had been done such that there would be no shadows or sharp shadows.  Maybe crop in from top and bottom a bit.', '2003-11-24 18:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(493894, 48274, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea to have a double exposure.  Perhpas a bit brighter would help us to see your face better?  I''ve never tried this so I don''t know.</td>', 'Interesting idea to have a double exposure.  Perhpas a bit brighter would help us to see your face better?  I''ve never tried this so I don''t know.', '2003-11-24 18:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(493895, 48177, 7369, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much. Great capture of the moment! I think this is one of the few that really meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like this photo very much. Great capture of the moment! I think this is one of the few that really meets the challenge.', '2003-11-24 18:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(493896, 48304, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wish we could see the look on your face.  The colors here are a bit washed out, and the focus is off.</td>', 'Wish we could see the look on your face.  The colors here are a bit washed out, and the focus is off.', '2003-11-24 18:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(493903, 48308, 7628, '<td valign="top">Yes, she does look like she''s up to mischief, and perhaps she''s blurred because she never stop moving.  But the kitchen floor background and the chair legs are distracting, and the red eyes from the flash take away from this beautiful little face.</td>', 'Yes, she does look like she''s up to mischief, and perhaps she''s blurred because she never stop moving.  But the kitchen floor background and the chair legs are distracting, and the red eyes from the flash take away from this beautiful little face.', '2003-11-24 18:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(493906, 48173, 7628, '<td valign="top">An applerange!  Delicious.  A novel idea. I like the texture of the orange peel - light is a bit bright on the top right. The whole thing feels a bit over sharpened.</td>', 'An applerange!  Delicious.  A novel idea. I like the texture of the orange peel - light is a bit bright on the top right. The whole thing feels a bit over sharpened.', '2003-11-24 18:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(493913, 47959, 7628, '<td valign="top">Sinister lighting, nice set up to give real expressions to these figures.  I like the texture and detail that we see even in th box (Tho'' I wish the box where just plain black so as not to distract from the figures)  The bit of white band showing behind the "woman''s" feet is distracting too.  But obviously a lot of work and thought on your part, nicely done. 8</td>', 'Sinister lighting, nice set up to give real expressions to these figures.  I like the texture and detail that we see even in th box (Tho'' I wish the box where just plain black so as not to distract from the figures)  The bit of white band showing behind the "woman''s" feet is distracting too.  But obviously a lot of work and thought on your part, nicely done. 8', '2003-11-24 18:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(493920, 47816, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting the Hawaiian t-shirt on a street boy in India.  He looks more tired than surprised.  The monkey seems to be controlling him and not the other way around.  An interesting photo that captures the moment.</td>', 'Interesting the Hawaiian t-shirt on a street boy in India.  He looks more tired than surprised.  The monkey seems to be controlling him and not the other way around.  An interesting photo that captures the moment.', '2003-11-24 18:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(493929, 47791, 11241, '<td valign="top">Great photo i love the colors!  great work</td>', 'Great photo i love the colors!  great work', '2003-11-24 18:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(493939, 48144, 14401, '<td valign="top">Excellent expression, doesn''t appear contrived - beautiful mood for the photograph.</td>', 'Excellent expression, doesn''t appear contrived - beautiful mood for the photograph.', '2003-11-24 19:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(493940, 48205, 7628, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo, but I don''t see how it meets this challenge - I''d vote an 8 on its own merits (the hands could be shaper ) I like the feel of the settting sun in the light...</td>', 'A lovely photo, but I don''t see how it meets this challenge - I''d vote an 8 on its own merits (the hands could be shaper ) I like the feel of the settting sun in the light...', '2003-11-24 19:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(493953, 48161, 6667, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  Spontanious.  Just wish the noise was reduced and the contrast was a little more even.  Best of luck.  Still got a high mark from me.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  Spontanious.  Just wish the noise was reduced and the contrast was a little more even.  Best of luck.  Still got a high mark from me.', '2003-11-24 19:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
