(493965, 48313, 11769, '<td valign="top">That would be the surprise of your life. A lot of us have been there and just got out of the way in time.  That is a feeling of fear and surprise.</td>', 'That would be the surprise of your life. A lot of us have been there and just got out of the way in time.  That is a feeling of fear and surprise.', '2003-11-24 19:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
