(493979, 48274, 11769, '<td valign="top">Maybe to dark, but then again we can scare ourselves in the dark, at least I can.</td>', 'Maybe to dark, but then again we can scare ourselves in the dark, at least I can.', '2003-11-24 19:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(494049, 48301, 12448, '<td valign="top">There is a look of surprise here, no doubt but the fingers hurt this shot to me, it''s almost as if they are trying to pull the eyes down to help create the shot when I''m betting it was supposed to be a hand clapped over the mouth?<br/> <br/>The lighting is a bit harsh overall on this shot and the dark shadows under the eyes is distracting.  The focus is also a bit wanting.  Started with a 4 but will go to a 5</td>', 'There is a look of surprise here, no doubt but the fingers hurt this shot to me, it''s almost as if they are trying to pull the eyes down to help create the shot when I''m betting it was supposed to be a hand clapped over the mouth? The lighting is a bit harsh overall on this shot and the dark shadows under the eyes is distracting.  The focus is also a bit wanting.  Started with a 4 but will go to a 5', '2003-11-24 20:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(494058, 48141, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh, what could it be?  I think I understand what you are going for here but it doesn''t really convey surprise or anticipation to me.  It''s a light in a wood man''s hands and it''s really kind of boring overall.  The focus is really wanting in this shot, the noise is a bit much also.  A 5</td>', 'Oh, what could it be?  I think I understand what you are going for here but it doesn''t really convey surprise or anticipation to me.  It''s a light in a wood man''s hands and it''s really kind of boring overall.  The focus is really wanting in this shot, the noise is a bit much also.  A 5', '2003-11-24 21:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(494074, 47959, 12448, '<td valign="top">I see what you are going for here, the element of surprise is on the wood many while the wood woman comes along without a care in the world.  And while this may work in real life, in wood life the set up is there but knowing that the execution of the prank will never truly be pulled off hurts the shot to me.  The shot also seems a bit dark and there are light flares on the dolls themselves.<br/> <br/>Perhaps if you could get someone to help you pull this on someone else and you could shot it from set up to the end result?  A 5</td>', 'I see what you are going for here, the element of surprise is on the wood many while the wood woman comes along without a care in the world.  And while this may work in real life, in wood life the set up is there but knowing that the execution of the prank will never truly be pulled off hurts the shot to me.  The shot also seems a bit dark and there are light flares on the dolls themselves. Perhaps if you could get someone to help you pull this on someone else and you could shot it from set up to the end result?  A 5', '2003-11-24 21:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(494076, 48250, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it is and the person who is in the pool is in for a bit of a shock but to me they are already preparing for the splash with the closed, scrunched eyes.    This is a decent stop action shot and the look of "YEAHAW!" on his face is very well done.  The cropping could be a bit tighter on the sides, taking out the distracting signs and the bright sun in the upper left.  A 5</td>', 'Yes it is and the person who is in the pool is in for a bit of a shock but to me they are already preparing for the splash with the closed, scrunched eyes.    This is a decent stop action shot and the look of "YEAHAW!" on his face is very well done.  The cropping could be a bit tighter on the sides, taking out the distracting signs and the bright sun in the upper left.  A 5', '2003-11-24 21:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(494079, 47816, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure how this meets the challenge, the boy looks neither excited or surprised, more of a "poor sad me, help me" look, now if the monkey had turned on you and started coming at you...........<br/> <br/>The shot is a bit dark in the upper left and the title says monkeys but I only see one, though I''m sure the other rope leads to another.  A 5</td>', 'Not quite sure how this meets the challenge, the boy looks neither excited or surprised, more of a "poor sad me, help me" look, now if the monkey had turned on you and started coming at you........... The shot is a bit dark in the upper left and the title says monkeys but I only see one, though I''m sure the other rope leads to another.  A 5', '2003-11-24 21:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(494084, 48304, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''d be more surprised if you didn''t see any, sadly it''s the norm these days, not many places you can to and get away from it all.<br/> <br/>The shot is a bit dull, lacks punch and pop, the dull colors could use a bit of contrast   A 5</td>', 'I''d be more surprised if you didn''t see any, sadly it''s the norm these days, not many places you can to and get away from it all. The shot is a bit dull, lacks punch and pop, the dull colors could use a bit of contrast   A 5', '2003-11-24 21:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(494095, 48278, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh ouch!  Poor person!  My bum is sore just looking at this!  It fits the challenge perfectly now if only the camera had been able to get a slightly shaper shot.  I know the person is falling but the blur on the whole shot is just a bit too much, probably because I''m guessing you were shocked by what was happening as well.  A 5</td>', 'Oh ouch!  Poor person!  My bum is sore just looking at this!  It fits the challenge perfectly now if only the camera had been able to get a slightly shaper shot.  I know the person is falling but the blur on the whole shot is just a bit too much, probably because I''m guessing you were shocked by what was happening as well.  A 5', '2003-11-24 22:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(494097, 47613, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but the look doesn''t quite fit the title.  I don''t know if this was posed or not but it just seems slightly off to me.  Can''t quite place my finger on it.  I''ll probably be back to try to figure it out.  The lighting is a bit too dull and the hand with the cupcake almost looks like a maniquin hand and that is one tiny cupcake!<br/> <br/> A 5 to start but I''ll be back.</td>', 'Nice concept but the look doesn''t quite fit the title.  I don''t know if this was posed or not but it just seems slightly off to me.  Can''t quite place my finger on it.  I''ll probably be back to try to figure it out.  The lighting is a bit too dull and the hand with the cupcake almost looks like a maniquin hand and that is one tiny cupcake!  A 5 to start but I''ll be back.', '2003-11-24 22:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(494098, 48199, 12448, '<td valign="top">Perfect!  I''m guessing from the soaked t-shirt that is wasn''t the first take?  You have a very understanding model there!  A 10</td>', 'Perfect!  I''m guessing from the soaked t-shirt that is wasn''t the first take?  You have a very understanding model there!  A 10', '2003-11-24 22:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(494099, 48265, 12448, '<td valign="top">That would certainly surprise me to open my hard boiled egg and find a little mouse, LOL!  Very cute I"m gave this a 9 but raised to a 10 but I would have really liked to see the little guy looking at the camera, it would have added that extra little touch.</td>', 'That would certainly surprise me to open my hard boiled egg and find a little mouse, LOL!  Very cute I"m gave this a 9 but raised to a 10 but I would have really liked to see the little guy looking at the camera, it would have added that extra little touch.', '2003-11-24 22:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(494101, 48138, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  The clarity, the sharpness, the shock of finding a lifesaver in my M&amp;m''s, that would be a surprise for sure!  A 10</td>', 'I love this one.  The clarity, the sharpness, the shock of finding a lifesaver in my M&m''s, that would be a surprise for sure!  A 10', '2003-11-24 22:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(494102, 47791, 12448, '<td valign="top">BOOM!!!!  Been there, done that and dang if it doesn''t make me jump every time!  This is close to perfect, what would make it perfect to me you ask?  The light not glaring on the balloon and the shadow being gone.  Maybe coming at from a different angle or using another light to fill in and help defuse the one?  A 9</td>', 'BOOM!!!!  Been there, done that and dang if it doesn''t make me jump every time!  This is close to perfect, what would make it perfect to me you ask?  The light not glaring on the balloon and the shadow being gone.  Maybe coming at from a different angle or using another light to fill in and help defuse the one?  A 9', '2003-11-24 22:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(494104, 48318, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes, she does look surprised, happy, elated!  Well done!  The cropp is a bit off to me, the arms getting cut off is a bit bothersome to me.  The colors are fantastic and the DOF is well done.  The focus suggests just a hint of motion which is happening so that works as well.  An 8</td>', 'Yes, she does look surprised, happy, elated!  Well done!  The cropp is a bit off to me, the arms getting cut off is a bit bothersome to me.  The colors are fantastic and the DOF is well done.  The focus suggests just a hint of motion which is happening so that works as well.  An 8', '2003-11-24 22:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(494105, 48034, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  I would be shocked to find him/her in my bouquet of roses that''s for sure!  An excellent shot overall, the cropping is well done, could be just a tad tighter on the right for me personally but the top is nice, you didn''t lose the antenna of the praying mantis.  The colors are well done but the lighting is just a tad dull to me, just a touch mind you.  An 8 to start but I''ll be back.</td>', 'Oh my!  I would be shocked to find him/her in my bouquet of roses that''s for sure!  An excellent shot overall, the cropping is well done, could be just a tad tighter on the right for me personally but the top is nice, you didn''t lose the antenna of the praying mantis.  The colors are well done but the lighting is just a tad dull to me, just a touch mind you.  An 8 to start but I''ll be back.', '2003-11-24 22:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(494107, 48161, 12448, '<td valign="top">He looks more amused than surprised by the flying birds.  A nice shot overall but just misses the concept of the challenge to me.  The other little boy is way to calm, maybe if they had both looked a bit more surprised or even shocked.  An 8</td>', 'He looks more amused than surprised by the flying birds.  A nice shot overall but just misses the concept of the challenge to me.  The other little boy is way to calm, maybe if they had both looked a bit more surprised or even shocked.  An 8', '2003-11-24 22:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(494108, 48284, 12448, '<td valign="top">HAHAH!  that happened to me!  FOr real! :)  Great shot, an 8</td>', 'HAHAH!  that happened to me!  FOr real! :)  Great shot, an 8', '2003-11-24 22:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
