(494111, 48302, 12448, '<td valign="top">Dad''s look is perfect, the boys are close but just miss the mark.   And yes, I would love to know what they are looking at!  Under the Scotman''s kilt perhaps?  LOL!  Well done, the black and white works well for this shot but the back light is just a bit harsh.  An 8</td>', 'Dad''s look is perfect, the boys are close but just miss the mark.   And yes, I would love to know what they are looking at!  Under the Scotman''s kilt perhaps?  LOL!  Well done, the black and white works well for this shot but the back light is just a bit harsh.  An 8', '2003-11-24 22:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
