(496287, 48207, 6999, '<td valign="top">Smoke signals? Is that the point? I looked at this for ages and didn''t get it, and have just realised that on coming back to comment a bit. Beyond whether or not this meets the challenge, I think it lacks shape as a photograph: the compositional balance of the various elements is quite heavy-handed (the house coming into the frame almost to the halfway point, the angles and colours of the pile of stuff by the door catching the eye most, and the lack of any great progression of light in the frame. The colours throughout are well caught, but are for me too natural, to ordinary, too everyday: you aren''t showing me anything special here, if you follow me.</td>', 'Smoke signals? Is that the point? I looked at this for ages and didn''t get it, and have just realised that on coming back to comment a bit. Beyond whether or not this meets the challenge, I think it lacks shape as a photograph: the compositional balance of the various elements is quite heavy-handed (the house coming into the frame almost to the halfway point, the angles and colours of the pile of stuff by the door catching the eye most, and the lack of any great progression of light in the frame. The colours throughout are well caught, but are for me too natural, to ordinary, too everyday: you aren''t showing me anything special here, if you follow me.', '2003-11-26 19:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
