(496825, 48259, 8953, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! The young guy looks truly surprised. I might have cropped a little tighter on both sides, the background pulls you away from the subject. The shadow under the jaw line is tough to get around with a flash, I have used a sheet of white paper just in front of the flash to soften and give the over all image a more balanced feel. I hope this helps:) Good Luck.</td>', 'I love this shot! The young guy looks truly surprised. I might have cropped a little tighter on both sides, the background pulls you away from the subject. The shadow under the jaw line is tough to get around with a flash, I have used a sheet of white paper just in front of the flash to soften and give the over all image a more balanced feel. I hope this helps:) Good Luck.', '2003-11-27 10:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(496829, 47816, 8953, '<td valign="top">A nice candid capture. I am not sure about the surprise part though. more a photojournalism kind of shot. would have liked to have seen the whole monkey. good luck:)</td>', 'A nice candid capture. I am not sure about the surprise part though. more a photojournalism kind of shot. would have liked to have seen the whole monkey. good luck:)', '2003-11-27 10:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(496834, 48005, 8953, '<td valign="top">A nice B&amp;W  photo:) what I imight have tried to do would have been to have kept the flash down a bit by reflecting or difusing it. I have used a white sheet of paper when I had to use a built in flash. I would hold it about three inches in front of flash. Hope this helps:)</td>', 'A nice B&W  photo:) what I imight have tried to do would have been to have kept the flash down a bit by reflecting or difusing it. I have used a white sheet of paper when I had to use a built in flash. I would hold it about three inches in front of flash. Hope this helps:)', '2003-11-27 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(496838, 48161, 9550, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull Photo. I really like the birds stopped in motion. And the surprise on Josh''s face. Very good lighting, nice B&amp;W.</td>', 'Wonderfull Photo. I really like the birds stopped in motion. And the surprise on Josh''s face. Very good lighting, nice B&W.', '2003-11-27 10:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(496851, 48265, 13247, '<td valign="top">interesting idea. did you use tape to hold the eg together?</td>', 'interesting idea. did you use tape to hold the eg together?', '2003-11-27 11:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(496882, 48005, 7485, '<td valign="top">Too contrasty. Hand in particular needs more tonal range. Also, for a closeup like this, the glass really needs to be sparkling clean. But I like the composition and idea! 5</td>', 'Too contrasty. Hand in particular needs more tonal range. Also, for a closeup like this, the glass really needs to be sparkling clean. But I like the composition and idea! 5', '2003-11-27 12:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(496884, 48161, 7485, '<td valign="top">Background is too distracting, but the kids are just great! 5</td>', 'Background is too distracting, but the kids are just great! 5', '2003-11-27 12:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(496890, 48141, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting effect, but without the title it has nothing to do with surprise. 5</td>', 'Very interesting lighting effect, but without the title it has nothing to do with surprise. 5', '2003-11-27 12:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(496892, 47816, 7485, '<td valign="top">The look in the boy''s eyes is quite something. Sadly, it''s more a look of longing than surprise. Touching photo, but wrong challenge.</td>', 'The look in the boy''s eyes is quite something. Sadly, it''s more a look of longing than surprise. Touching photo, but wrong challenge.', '2003-11-27 12:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(496893, 48144, 7485, '<td valign="top">First photo so far that shows a genuine look of surprise (or a great actress!) 7</td>', 'First photo so far that shows a genuine look of surprise (or a great actress!) 7', '2003-11-27 12:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(496898, 48323, 7485, '<td valign="top">Okay, so the label says there''s a surprise inside... that is supposed to convey the feeling of surprise?!? Technically fine photo, but the idea leaves me stone cold. 3</td>', 'Okay, so the label says there''s a surprise inside... that is supposed to convey the feeling of surprise?!? Technically fine photo, but the idea leaves me stone cold. 3', '2003-11-27 12:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(496899, 48265, 7485, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but wish it was looking towards me. 6</td>', 'Cute idea, but wish it was looking towards me. 6', '2003-11-27 12:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(496900, 47791, 7485, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the simplicity of the idea, but I''d use a different (or no) frame</td>', 'Love the colors and the simplicity of the idea, but I''d use a different (or no) frame', '2003-11-27 12:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(496905, 48295, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very funny idea and great expression. Could be sharper, and side light on the face and bottle would have mad the key points stand out better. 6</td>', 'Very funny idea and great expression. Could be sharper, and side light on the face and bottle would have mad the key points stand out better. 6', '2003-11-27 12:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(496907, 47975, 7485, '<td valign="top">A very interesting idea and a really great photo (lighting, composition, and DOF are all spot on), but maybe a little too abstract for this challenge? 8</td>', 'A very interesting idea and a really great photo (lighting, composition, and DOF are all spot on), but maybe a little too abstract for this challenge? 8', '2003-11-27 13:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(496908, 48126, 7485, '<td valign="top">How is this supposed to convey the feeling of surprise? 3</td>', 'How is this supposed to convey the feeling of surprise? 3', '2003-11-27 13:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(497017, 48278, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind that the climber is in motion, but the whole picture has has motion blur. If you were trying to do a panning shot, the climber should be in focus and the rocks more blurred.</td>', 'I don''t mind that the climber is in motion, but the whole picture has has motion blur. If you were trying to do a panning shot, the climber should be in focus and the rocks more blurred.', '2003-11-27 17:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(497029, 48284, 11800, '<td valign="top">You are on the right path. Not that I''m good at set ups, but concerning this picture, here is what I would change to make it more "real". The test box is placed to square in the composition. The Happy birthday sign is too big and obvious. Buy, make or use an old card and place it somewhere within the scene where it looks casual. The lighting is good and I like the expression as the model looks at the results. Use some more props such as pens, papers, electronics, so the scene doesn''t look to sterile(pun not intended) and unused.  It looks oversharpened also.</td>', 'You are on the right path. Not that I''m good at set ups, but concerning this picture, here is what I would change to make it more "real". The test box is placed to square in the composition. The Happy birthday sign is too big and obvious. Buy, make or use an old card and place it somewhere within the scene where it looks casual. The lighting is good and I like the expression as the model looks at the results. Use some more props such as pens, papers, electronics, so the scene doesn''t look to sterile(pun not intended) and unused.  It looks oversharpened also.', '2003-11-27 18:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(497033, 48046, 11800, '<td valign="top">Funny. I like it and can hear the kid saying that! That''s a pretty mean thing to do to a defenseless kid with his peepee hanging out! But it worked.lol</td>', 'Funny. I like it and can hear the kid saying that! That''s a pretty mean thing to do to a defenseless kid with his peepee hanging out! But it worked.lol', '2003-11-27 18:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(497042, 48173, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice set up. The only thing I don''t like about it, is the oversharpening. Way too much. The white lines almost destroy all the hard work you did to set up the shot. 7</td>', 'Nice set up. The only thing I don''t like about it, is the oversharpening. Way too much. The white lines almost destroy all the hard work you did to set up the shot. 7', '2003-11-27 18:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(497057, 48199, 11800, '<td valign="top">Let me join the masses. How could this not win! 10 <br/>I do feel that he should have changed tees after every attempt! Seeing that his shirt is wet, but the water is just barely hitting him sorta destroys the illusion. But that isn''t trying to take anything away from the shot. It''s perfectly excellent.</td>', 'Let me join the masses. How could this not win! 10 I do feel that he should have changed tees after every attempt! Seeing that his shirt is wet, but the water is just barely hitting him sorta destroys the illusion. But that isn''t trying to take anything away from the shot. It''s perfectly excellent.', '2003-11-27 18:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(497058, 48207, 11800, '<td valign="top">Smoke signals? Too subtle for my old slow brain.</td>', 'Smoke signals? Too subtle for my old slow brain.', '2003-11-27 18:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(497062, 48302, 14001, '<td valign="top">Funny, the boys did a better job of acting (err over-acting) than Dad!  Still good shot.</td>', 'Funny, the boys did a better job of acting (err over-acting) than Dad!  Still good shot.', '2003-11-27 18:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(497064, 48199, 14001, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  His shirt shouldn''t already be soaked in the front.  Should have changed shirts between shots.</td>', 'Good shot.  His shirt shouldn''t already be soaked in the front.  Should have changed shirts between shots.', '2003-11-27 18:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(497066, 48034, 14001, '<td valign="top">Great pic!  Very natural.  My choice of best pic.</td>', 'Great pic!  Very natural.  My choice of best pic.', '2003-11-27 18:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(497090, 48177, 9868, '<td valign="top">I really like this photos, Please give it a 9. Partial to animal photos.</td>', 'I really like this photos, Please give it a 9. Partial to animal photos.', '2003-11-27 19:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(497093, 47801, 9868, '<td valign="top">I give this one a 8.</td>', 'I give this one a 8.', '2003-11-27 19:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(497184, 48126, 11769, '<td valign="top">This happens to me all the time. What''s going on?</td>', 'This happens to me all the time. What''s going on?', '2003-11-27 21:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497189, 48213, 11769, '<td valign="top">What. A SURPRISE? :)</td>', 'What. A SURPRISE? :)', '2003-11-27 21:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(497192, 48173, 11769, '<td valign="top">This has happened to me before. Just kidding. Nice photo.</td>', 'This has happened to me before. Just kidding. Nice photo.', '2003-11-27 21:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(497194, 48284, 11769, '<td valign="top">Good use of thirds with the face showing surprise. Nice focus. Hope it''s a good surprise</td>', 'Good use of thirds with the face showing surprise. Nice focus. Hope it''s a good surprise', '2003-11-27 21:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(497213, 48247, 8953, '<td valign="top">I hate it when someone jumps out at me:) I always try to hide the surprise...LOL this is a nice idea. the image could use a bit more balance in terms of the space it was shot. the opening to the back of the room is a bit distracting....may have worked better if the lights were on in the hall and over the door?</td>', 'I hate it when someone jumps out at me:) I always try to hide the surprise...LOL this is a nice idea. the image could use a bit more balance in terms of the space it was shot. the opening to the back of the room is a bit distracting....may have worked better if the lights were on in the hall and over the door?', '2003-11-27 22:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(497218, 48301, 8953, '<td valign="top">well this one is in your face.:) funny shot. tad out of focus though. would have done better to have had the subject a greater distance from the lens then cropped.</td>', 'well this one is in your face.:) funny shot. tad out of focus though. would have done better to have had the subject a greater distance from the lens then cropped.', '2003-11-27 22:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(497313, 48202, 8953, '<td valign="top">Always a pleasent surprise:) Something just did not seem to work out with this shot. seems both over sharpened and way to much contrast. maybe this would have worked better with not so strong a flash? concept is good though:)</td>', 'Always a pleasent surprise:) Something just did not seem to work out with this shot. seems both over sharpened and way to much contrast. maybe this would have worked better with not so strong a flash? concept is good though:)', '2003-11-28 02:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497318, 48308, 8953, '<td valign="top">A cute child:)  the problem is no spot editing...so no way to fix the red eye:) she does look like she has been caught doing something.</td>', 'A cute child:)  the problem is no spot editing...so no way to fix the red eye:) she does look like she has been caught doing something.', '2003-11-28 02:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(497497, 48265, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent work... = 10</td>', 'excellent work... = 10', '2003-11-28 10:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(497553, 48265, 10402, '<td valign="top">Creative and attractive image, technically very well done. The juxtaposition of elements works very well here. Maybe if it looked more like the mammal was hatching, or it was being served to a diner it would convey surprise better. As is, it is just a nice setting for a cute photo.</td>', 'Creative and attractive image, technically very well done. The juxtaposition of elements works very well here. Maybe if it looked more like the mammal was hatching, or it was being served to a diner it would convey surprise better. As is, it is just a nice setting for a cute photo.', '2003-11-28 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(497561, 48302, 10402, '<td valign="top">The boy on the left looks fascinated, the man looks terrified, and the boy on the right looks bewildered. All are facets of surprise.</td>', 'The boy on the left looks fascinated, the man looks terrified, and the boy on the right looks bewildered. All are facets of surprise.', '2003-11-28 13:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(497563, 48316, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and the girl has a great surprised expression. If only determining the sex of a cat were so easy!</td>', 'Good idea, and the girl has a great surprised expression. If only determining the sex of a cat were so easy!', '2003-11-28 13:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(497567, 47747, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice photo that works well in black and white. I''m sure surprise was involved (either you surprised her or she surprised you), but it doesn''t really show here.</td>', 'Nice photo that works well in black and white. I''m sure surprise was involved (either you surprised her or she surprised you), but it doesn''t really show here.', '2003-11-28 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(497568, 48199, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great stop action, and the model does seem surprised. I think the photo would be more effective if the shirt was dry.</td>', 'Great stop action, and the model does seem surprised. I think the photo would be more effective if the shirt was dry.', '2003-11-28 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(497807, 48265, 8911, '<td valign="top">That would definitely be a surprise - and is very cute. I like the detail on this shot - how clear the cracks in the shell are, the mouse''s fur, the whiskers visible against the background. Very clean - no extra clutter - and very crisp and clear. Easy to believe it''s right in front of me.</td>', 'That would definitely be a surprise - and is very cute. I like the detail on this shot - how clear the cracks in the shell are, the mouse''s fur, the whiskers visible against the background. Very clean - no extra clutter - and very crisp and clear. Easy to believe it''s right in front of me.', '2003-11-28 19:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(497808, 47975, 8911, '<td valign="top">Okay, that''s seriously disturbing. In the good way. I would definitely find that a surprising thing to be facing! Nice trick of photography - the softness of the ''eye'' works well here.</td>', 'Okay, that''s seriously disturbing. In the good way. I would definitely find that a surprising thing to be facing! Nice trick of photography - the softness of the ''eye'' works well here.', '2003-11-28 19:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(497810, 48295, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice staging; from all I''ve heard of Nair, I imagine that would hurt like a mad thing, too. Very effectively disturbing - I was holding my hair tightly when I saw this and just wincing. The bit of suds in the upper left is slightly disturbing, even as it gives context - maybe showing a bit more of the head would have worked better?</td>', 'Nice staging; from all I''ve heard of Nair, I imagine that would hurt like a mad thing, too. Very effectively disturbing - I was holding my hair tightly when I saw this and just wincing. The bit of suds in the upper left is slightly disturbing, even as it gives context - maybe showing a bit more of the head would have worked better?', '2003-11-28 19:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(497815, 48144, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I''d class that as much shock as surprise, but that''s a subset of the same thing, so.... Very nicely set up. The depth of focus may be a bit shallow - the near eye is very crisp, the one further away a bit blurry as it''s already starting to go out of focus, which seems somewhat odd.</td>', 'Nice shot - I''d class that as much shock as surprise, but that''s a subset of the same thing, so.... Very nicely set up. The depth of focus may be a bit shallow - the near eye is very crisp, the one further away a bit blurry as it''s already starting to go out of focus, which seems somewhat odd.', '2003-11-28 19:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(497817, 48202, 8911, '<td valign="top">Very crisp picture, and I like the lack of color here...but it doesn''t say surprise to me, very much. There''s nothing in the picture that conveys to me that it was a surprise, only that I am being told (by the fact that it''s in this challenge) that it is. A very nice picture, though.</td>', 'Very crisp picture, and I like the lack of color here...but it doesn''t say surprise to me, very much. There''s nothing in the picture that conveys to me that it was a surprise, only that I am being told (by the fact that it''s in this challenge) that it is. A very nice picture, though.', '2003-11-28 19:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(497822, 48308, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Focus is an issue - the edges of her hair are blurred - and she''s got a pretty serious case of red-eye as well. Some retakes on this to try to get a clearer picture (of the girl: the background being blurred out is good) might have been good.</td>', 'Nice subject. Focus is an issue - the edges of her hair are blurred - and she''s got a pretty serious case of red-eye as well. Some retakes on this to try to get a clearer picture (of the girl: the background being blurred out is good) might have been good.', '2003-11-28 19:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(497826, 48324, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a neat one for this topic and the focus and framing are nice. I find teh triple-flash from the earring very distracting, though - my eyes keep going back to it as if it was meant to be the subject of the photo, which doesn''t seem to be the case.</td>', 'This is a neat one for this topic and the focus and framing are nice. I find teh triple-flash from the earring very distracting, though - my eyes keep going back to it as if it was meant to be the subject of the photo, which doesn''t seem to be the case.', '2003-11-28 19:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(497877, 48074, 12448, '<td valign="top">It that''s a real bird, that is amazing!  Looks like it was a bit windy that day and I like the clarity of the shot bu there is something that seems a bit off to me.  I''m not sure if it''s the bird or what.  It just doesn''t seem to fit.  And the two different colors of hair, one is a darker blonde underneath while the top is a lighter grey, makes me wonder if it''s a wig.  The cropping could also be a little tighter on the top.    A a6</td>', 'It that''s a real bird, that is amazing!  Looks like it was a bit windy that day and I like the clarity of the shot bu there is something that seems a bit off to me.  I''m not sure if it''s the bird or what.  It just doesn''t seem to fit.  And the two different colors of hair, one is a darker blonde underneath while the top is a lighter grey, makes me wonder if it''s a wig.  The cropping could also be a little tighter on the top.    A a6', '2003-11-28 21:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(497889, 48203, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful idea for the challenge and the best kind of surprise.  The lighting on this shot seems a bit harsh, a little toning down would really make this shot work.  The wall paper is very distracting, a different setting possibly?  A 6</td>', 'This is a wonderful idea for the challenge and the best kind of surprise.  The lighting on this shot seems a bit harsh, a little toning down would really make this shot work.  The wall paper is very distracting, a different setting possibly?  A 6', '2003-11-28 21:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(497892, 48215, 12448, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwwwwwwww!  How cute is he/she?  A wonderful surprise for anyone!  The shot isn''t bad overall but the dog is over lit against the black background.  Maybe a more direct, head on shot with a softer light?  A 6</td>', 'Awwwwwwwwwwww!  How cute is he/she?  A wonderful surprise for anyone!  The shot isn''t bad overall but the dog is over lit against the black background.  Maybe a more direct, head on shot with a softer light?  A 6', '2003-11-28 21:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(497893, 48126, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a cute idea!  Turn your head for a second and WHAM, part of one is missing or in my house, the whole pile would be gone, LOL!<br/> <br/>I like this idea but the cookies would have looked better on a plate instead of the paper towel or even a plain napkin, no distracting patterns.  The light is also a bit harsh, though well distributed on both sides, I''m betting a split screen shot, my Olympus can do that also, it''s a fun feature to use sometimes.  A 6</td>', 'What a cute idea!  Turn your head for a second and WHAM, part of one is missing or in my house, the whole pile would be gone, LOL! I like this idea but the cookies would have looked better on a plate instead of the paper towel or even a plain napkin, no distracting patterns.  The light is also a bit harsh, though well distributed on both sides, I''m betting a split screen shot, my Olympus can do that also, it''s a fun feature to use sometimes.  A 6', '2003-11-28 21:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(497894, 48323, 12448, '<td valign="top">These days it would be a tattoo or a little sticker, they don''t pack much of a surprise anymore.  This is a good shot overall but the cracker jacks seems a bit over sharp and where are those peanuts?  That''s the best part! :)<br/> <br/>The white background is a good choice but seems a bit blown out on the right hand side.  Started with a 6, going to an 8</td>', 'These days it would be a tattoo or a little sticker, they don''t pack much of a surprise anymore.  This is a good shot overall but the cracker jacks seems a bit over sharp and where are those peanuts?  That''s the best part! :) The white background is a good choice but seems a bit blown out on the right hand side.  Started with a 6, going to an 8', '2003-11-28 21:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(497896, 47801, 12448, '<td valign="top">That would be quite the surprise on the duck, no?<br/> <br/>A good idea and excellent capture but the pigdon is already past the duck from what I can see so the element of surprise is kinda lost to me.  And the water seems almost too sharp as does the duck, it has a very sharp line around it on my monitor and I can''t quite place my finger on it but the colors seem just too bright for some reason.  A 6</td>', 'That would be quite the surprise on the duck, no? A good idea and excellent capture but the pigdon is already past the duck from what I can see so the element of surprise is kinda lost to me.  And the water seems almost too sharp as does the duck, it has a very sharp line around it on my monitor and I can''t quite place my finger on it but the colors seem just too bright for some reason.  A 6', '2003-11-28 21:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(497897, 48240, 12448, '<td valign="top">Is that little guy real?  If not, he sure looks it, LOL!<br/> <br/>A great idea and I too would be very surprised to find an alligator outside my tub, but even more surprising would be to find the gator IN the tub as you are getting ready to take a bath.<br/> <br/>The expression on the little girl''s face is very good but she''s looking directly into the camera, if she was looking at the gator and screaming it would be more realistic and by looking down you might avoid the red eye that creeped in on you.  A 6</td>', 'Is that little guy real?  If not, he sure looks it, LOL! A great idea and I too would be very surprised to find an alligator outside my tub, but even more surprising would be to find the gator IN the tub as you are getting ready to take a bath. The expression on the little girl''s face is very good but she''s looking directly into the camera, if she was looking at the gator and screaming it would be more realistic and by looking down you might avoid the red eye that creeped in on you.  A 6', '2003-11-28 21:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(497899, 48314, 12448, '<td valign="top">But mine will be, LOL!  I bought it specifically for my business, :)<br/> <br/>A good idea but the contrast and brightness are missing from this picture, the mouth is a bit fuzzy while the letter, in the same DOF (to me), seems the whole shot should be clearer.<br/> <br/>Started with a 6, going to a 7</td>', 'But mine will be, LOL!  I bought it specifically for my business, :) A good idea but the contrast and brightness are missing from this picture, the mouth is a bit fuzzy while the letter, in the same DOF (to me), seems the whole shot should be clearer. Started with a 6, going to a 7', '2003-11-28 21:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(497902, 48161, 5475, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge!  You have captured true surprise, rather than set up, staged surprise!  The motion of the birds adds lots of interest, and the kids are really cute!  In fact, they look kind of like me!<br/>I give it a 10!<br/>JD</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge!  You have captured true surprise, rather than set up, staged surprise!  The motion of the birds adds lots of interest, and the kids are really cute!  In fact, they look kind of like me!I give it a 10!JD', '2003-11-28 21:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(497903, 48213, 12448, '<td valign="top">And this is a surprise to you? :)<br/> <br/>This isn''t very surprising overall but the shot is well done.  The colors work well for this shot and I like the set up, the upper right is a tad blown out, started at 6, moving to an 8</td>', 'And this is a surprise to you? :) This isn''t very surprising overall but the shot is well done.  The colors work well for this shot and I like the set up, the upper right is a tad blown out, started at 6, moving to an 8', '2003-11-28 22:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(497910, 48255, 12448, '<td valign="top">How mean!  I hope this wasn''t real, LOL!<br/> <br/>The look is very good, very realistic.  The lighting is a bit bright on the left and the right is rather dull.  An overall  balance would really make this shot work or even a frontal shot to see the shock in both his eyes!<br/> <br/>A 6</td>', 'How mean!  I hope this wasn''t real, LOL! The look is very good, very realistic.  The lighting is a bit bright on the left and the right is rather dull.  An overall  balance would really make this shot work or even a frontal shot to see the shock in both his eyes! A 6', '2003-11-28 22:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497913, 48283, 12448, '<td valign="top">I bet those birds were surprised to see you! ;)<br/> <br/>A great shot, I like the colors of the horizon, the birds, but the DOF bothers me on this shot for some reason.  I know the birds in the front are closer, there fore sharper but the others seem just a bit too blurry for the distance implied.<br/> <br/>I started at a 6, am going to a 7</td>', 'I bet those birds were surprised to see you! ;) A great shot, I like the colors of the horizon, the birds, but the DOF bothers me on this shot for some reason.  I know the birds in the front are closer, there fore sharper but the others seem just a bit too blurry for the distance implied. I started at a 6, am going to a 7', '2003-11-28 22:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(497925, 47437, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cute, though not sure why it''s so surprising but she certainly looks amused, LOL!<br/> <br/>This isn''t a bad shot overall, the candid nature works for this and the expression on her face is perfect for this challenge.  The wine glass and bottle are a bit distracting but unless you cleared the area in front of her first it would be hard to avoid.  The flash off the glass is also a bit distracting.  A 6</td>', 'Very cute, though not sure why it''s so surprising but she certainly looks amused, LOL! This isn''t a bad shot overall, the candid nature works for this and the expression on her face is perfect for this challenge.  The wine glass and bottle are a bit distracting but unless you cleared the area in front of her first it would be hard to avoid.  The flash off the glass is also a bit distracting.  A 6', '2003-11-28 22:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(497927, 48308, 12448, '<td valign="top">Rut Roh!  Busted! :)<br/> <br/>A cute expression on her face, makes you wonder if you really did catch her doing something she wasn''t supposed to be doing.  The red eye is a shame and the motion on the left is also a bit distracting.  A 6</td>', 'Rut Roh!  Busted! :) A cute expression on her face, makes you wonder if you really did catch her doing something she wasn''t supposed to be doing.  The red eye is a shame and the motion on the left is also a bit distracting.  A 6', '2003-11-28 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(497937, 48314, 12733, '<td valign="top">Quite a surprise. Could use more exposure, or correction for exposure in editing software.</td>', 'Quite a surprise. Could use more exposure, or correction for exposure in editing software.', '2003-11-28 23:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497940, 48202, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely thought for the challenge.  But the black and white really takes away from the shot for me.  There is too much sharpness and contrast between the finders and the background, I can practically take fingerprints off the man''s fingers.  Too much detail for a shot like this.  A 6</td>', 'This is a lovely thought for the challenge.  But the black and white really takes away from the shot for me.  There is too much sharpness and contrast between the finders and the background, I can practically take fingerprints off the man''s fingers.  Too much detail for a shot like this.  A 6', '2003-11-28 23:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(497944, 48313, 12448, '<td valign="top">ACK!  That would be scarey!  This is a good shot, the glare of the light is very well done as that is what you would see before you got hit.  Is the preson in front of car a dummy (manniquin)?  I ask because the back of the head looks very dented and the face doesn''t look quite real, no shock, no surprise.  A 6</td>', 'ACK!  That would be scarey!  This is a good shot, the glare of the light is very well done as that is what you would see before you got hit.  Is the preson in front of car a dummy (manniquin)?  I ask because the back of the head looks very dented and the face doesn''t look quite real, no shock, no surprise.  A 6', '2003-11-28 23:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(497947, 48144, 12448, '<td valign="top">Did you just tell her she can''t go out this weekend?  She looks like she''s about to cry, not sure why though.  <br/> <br/>The cropping took off her forehead and her chin, would have like a tighter crop on the left and higher on the top and bottom.  Started at a 6, going to a 7</td>', 'Did you just tell her she can''t go out this weekend?  She looks like she''s about to cry, not sure why though.   The cropping took off her forehead and her chin, would have like a tighter crop on the left and higher on the top and bottom.  Started at a 6, going to a 7', '2003-11-28 23:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(497951, 48163, 12448, '<td valign="top">Guess it doesn''t!  LOL!  A cute shot, a good idea but the boy doesn''t look very surprised to see a butterfly this time of year or that it landed on his head.  And yes, I know it''s not a real butterfly :)<br/> <br/>Also if the butterfly was placed on the nose with the more classic OMG look would really have worked with this.  A 6 to start, a 7 to finish</td>', 'Guess it doesn''t!  LOL!  A cute shot, a good idea but the boy doesn''t look very surprised to see a butterfly this time of year or that it landed on his head.  And yes, I know it''s not a real butterfly :) Also if the butterfly was placed on the nose with the more classic OMG look would really have worked with this.  A 6 to start, a 7 to finish', '2003-11-28 23:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(497954, 48281, 12448, '<td valign="top">YIKES!  That would the shocking!  The idea is excellent but the exacution of the shot leave me wanting.  The numbers on the phone are blown out and not very clear.  There is also some noise in the shot.  A 6</td>', 'YIKES!  That would the shocking!  The idea is excellent but the exacution of the shot leave me wanting.  The numbers on the phone are blown out and not very clear.  There is also some noise in the shot.  A 6', '2003-11-28 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(497956, 48274, 12448, '<td valign="top">A different idea and rather unique but the blurriness of the shot really hurts this shot.  If one was solid and the other transparent it would really have worked well.  A 6</td>', 'A different idea and rather unique but the blurriness of the shot really hurts this shot.  If one was solid and the other transparent it would really have worked well.  A 6', '2003-11-28 23:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(497963, 48133, 12448, '<td valign="top">Uh OH!  How embarassing and shocking! ;)<br/> <br/>A good idea for the challenge but the shot is a bit dull, maybe a bit more contrast?  Also the box is very dusty?  Kind of hurts the shot.  A 7</td>', 'Uh OH!  How embarassing and shocking! ;) A good idea for the challenge but the shot is a bit dull, maybe a bit more contrast?  Also the box is very dusty?  Kind of hurts the shot.  A 7', '2003-11-28 23:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(497985, 48207, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure I get this one.  I have looked and looked and looked and just don''t get the Indian reference.  If they are in the woods, I just can''t see them.  It''s a very nice shot overall, the colors, the clarity, the crop is well done.  A 7 to start, going to an 8</td>', 'I''m really not sure I get this one.  I have looked and looked and looked and just don''t get the Indian reference.  If they are in the woods, I just can''t see them.  It''s a very nice shot overall, the colors, the clarity, the crop is well done.  A 7 to start, going to an 8', '2003-11-28 23:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(497989, 48220, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it does.  As this gift lights up!  The light is a bit bright on the back and there is a blown out spot on the front top of the box.  I like the idea and the dark background is a good idea but is that a book on the left?  A 7</td>', 'Yes it does.  As this gift lights up!  The light is a bit bright on the back and there is a blown out spot on the front top of the box.  I like the idea and the dark background is a good idea but is that a book on the left?  A 7', '2003-11-28 23:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(497992, 48117, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha!  Very cute!  Does she do this often?  <br/> <br/>I like the idea, lots of fun for both I bet when shooting this.  The crop is a bit off to me, should be tighter on the left, so the fram is the edge of your shot.  Also the border, the small blue one is a bit distracting in the end.   A 7</td>', 'Hahahaha!  Very cute!  Does she do this often?   I like the idea, lots of fun for both I bet when shooting this.  The crop is a bit off to me, should be tighter on the left, so the fram is the edge of your shot.  Also the border, the small blue one is a bit distracting in the end.   A 7', '2003-11-28 23:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(497995, 48247, 12448, '<td valign="top">This almost got pulled off but the girl getting scared looks more like she''s set up than actually surprised.  The girl on the left doesn''t even look like she''s looking at the girl on the right, the motion is good since she would be jumping out, also the girl on the left seems a bit too far from the corner she would be hiding behind to scare the other girl.  Little things that jump out at me.  A 7</td>', 'This almost got pulled off but the girl getting scared looks more like she''s set up than actually surprised.  The girl on the left doesn''t even look like she''s looking at the girl on the right, the motion is good since she would be jumping out, also the girl on the left seems a bit too far from the corner she would be hiding behind to scare the other girl.  Little things that jump out at me.  A 7', '2003-11-28 23:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(497997, 48234, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh, hope you didn''t scare him too much!  They are such cute little things, one of the few animals I have never owned :)<br/> <br/>A good shot overall, the color, the clarity and the cropping is well done but the border hurts this shot on the sides, too heavy for the rest of the border and the shot.    Also if the crop was just a bit higher on the top, showing a bit much more of the hand.  Started at a 7, finishing with an 8</td>', 'Oh, hope you didn''t scare him too much!  They are such cute little things, one of the few animals I have never owned :) A good shot overall, the color, the clarity and the cropping is well done but the border hurts this shot on the sides, too heavy for the rest of the border and the shot.    Also if the crop was just a bit higher on the top, showing a bit much more of the hand.  Started at a 7, finishing with an 8', '2003-11-29 00:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(498003, 48046, 12448, '<td valign="top">Caught in the act, LOL!  very cute!  I like this shot, the expression on his face and the sepia coloring works well.  His hair looks off though, the dark on the top, is it that way naturally?    Also cutting of the top of his hair was a bit distracting.  Started at a 7, going to an 8</td>', 'Caught in the act, LOL!  very cute!  I like this shot, the expression on his face and the sepia coloring works well.  His hair looks off though, the dark on the top, is it that way naturally?    Also cutting of the top of his hair was a bit distracting.  Started at a 7, going to an 8', '2003-11-29 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(498005, 48295, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not a good thing, that''s for sure, LOL!  This would believable for me if I didn''t use Nair myself and know that it didn''t suds up like that.  But the concept is good, the expression is almost realistic and the woman is very brave for letting you shoot her in a towel, I know I wouldn''t do it, LOL!<br/> <br/>Started at a 7, going to an 8</td>', 'Not a good thing, that''s for sure, LOL!  This would believable for me if I didn''t use Nair myself and know that it didn''t suds up like that.  But the concept is good, the expression is almost realistic and the woman is very brave for letting you shoot her in a towel, I know I wouldn''t do it, LOL! Started at a 7, going to an 8', '2003-11-29 00:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(498008, 48324, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice picture overall, the star effects on the earring is a bit distracting to me, but the happiness expressed through her smile is very real and fun.  I like the crop and the way her hand is coming up, would like to see it a little more straight though, the angle is a bit too much for me.  Started at a 7, going to an 8</td>', 'A nice picture overall, the star effects on the earring is a bit distracting to me, but the happiness expressed through her smile is very real and fun.  I like the crop and the way her hand is coming up, would like to see it a little more straight though, the angle is a bit too much for me.  Started at a 7, going to an 8', '2003-11-29 00:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(498010, 47747, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not quite the caught in the headlights look but a nice capture none the less.  The light is a bit blown out on the left and the brightness could be brought down just a touch.  A 7</td>', 'Not quite the caught in the headlights look but a nice capture none the less.  The light is a bit blown out on the left and the brightness could be brought down just a touch.  A 7', '2003-11-29 00:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(498011, 48086, 12448, '<td valign="top">I don''t even want to know what that stuffed frog is doing with all the panties!   If someone was caught having a little fantasy play with the frog it would be very embarassing and if that person was caught with the frog it would have made this shot perfect.  A 7</td>', 'I don''t even want to know what that stuffed frog is doing with all the panties!   If someone was caught having a little fantasy play with the frog it would be very embarassing and if that person was caught with the frog it would have made this shot perfect.  A 7', '2003-11-29 00:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(498012, 48012, 12448, '<td valign="top">It can be sudden, can''t it?  The poor tree was caught off guard ;(<br/> <br/>The cropping is a bit off to me, I think I would have liked it more if the tree was more centered and not off to the right.  The contrast and brightness is also a bit off, a 7</td>', 'It can be sudden, can''t it?  The poor tree was caught off guard ;( The cropping is a bit off to me, I think I would have liked it more if the tree was more centered and not off to the right.  The contrast and brightness is also a bit off, a 7', '2003-11-29 00:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(498015, 48005, 12448, '<td valign="top">That is one big rock in the drink!  I like the idea, been a part of it before myself, helping a boyfriend surprise a friend of mine, LOL<br/> <br/>The hand is too bright and the glass looks like it has finger prints  on it.    The light off the stone in the glass is also a bit blown out.  A 5</td>', 'That is one big rock in the drink!  I like the idea, been a part of it before myself, helping a boyfriend surprise a friend of mine, LOL The hand is too bright and the glass looks like it has finger prints  on it.    The light off the stone in the glass is also a bit blown out.  A 5', '2003-11-29 00:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(498125, 48255, 8953, '<td valign="top">Fun capture. The wallpaper in the background is a bit distracting, but you managed the light on your subject well. there also seems to be something on his thumb? still does say surprise.</td>', 'Fun capture. The wallpaper in the background is a bit distracting, but you managed the light on your subject well. there also seems to be something on his thumb? still does say surprise.', '2003-11-29 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(498126, 48202, 9193, '<td valign="top">a bit dark, but I like the darkness of it... it gives it a nice effect...</td>', 'a bit dark, but I like the darkness of it... it gives it a nice effect...', '2003-11-29 01:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(498175, 48265, 4540, '<td valign="top">Very nice work! Eggshell is perfect, could be even with sharper remains to define harmony and also contrast of shapes. Backround could be more dramatic.  I am just sorry, I can''t vote.</td>', 'Very nice work! Eggshell is perfect, could be even with sharper remains to define harmony and also contrast of shapes. Backround could be more dramatic.  I am just sorry, I can''t vote.', '2003-11-29 05:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(498355, 48046, 7263, '<td valign="top"><b>Bad Points:</b> Skin is too soft and makes it look OOF, being near a toilet doesn''t make for a pretty picture ;) Also no eye contact!<br/><b>Good Points:</b> nice candid capture. Looks old.<br/><b>Overall Score:</b> 4</td>', 'Bad Points: Skin is too soft and makes it look OOF, being near a toilet doesn''t make for a pretty picture ;) Also no eye contact!Good Points: nice candid capture. Looks old.Overall Score: 4', '2003-11-29 10:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(498357, 47816, 7263, '<td valign="top"><b>Bad Points:</b> image format is too long for my taste -not sure about the suprise - he doesn''t look suprised<br/><b>Good Points:</b> as a reportage shot, this is tops. A great effort. But for the suprise...mm?<br/><b>Overall Score:</b> 4</td>', 'Bad Points: image format is too long for my taste -not sure about the suprise - he doesn''t look suprisedGood Points: as a reportage shot, this is tops. A great effort. But for the suprise...mm?Overall Score: 4', '2003-11-29 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(498370, 48314, 7304, '<td valign="top">Getting an audit is everyone''s surprise. I like the concept. I don''t really like the underexposed look. Wish it was not as underexposed. Overall not bad but I gave it a 5.</td>', 'Getting an audit is everyone''s surprise. I like the concept. I don''t really like the underexposed look. Wish it was not as underexposed. Overall not bad but I gave it a 5.', '2003-11-29 10:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(498375, 48177, 7304, '<td valign="top">Neat photo. Great focus and the light is right on. I wish the squirrel could have had its head cocked just a bit more towards the camera. But I like the photo.7</td>', 'Neat photo. Great focus and the light is right on. I wish the squirrel could have had its head cocked just a bit more towards the camera. But I like the photo.7', '2003-11-29 10:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(498433, 48283, 7628, '<td valign="top">Ok - I would be startled by a flock of seagulls busting into the air, I''m sure I  wouldn;t have the presence of mind to get such a good photo.  I love the layers of color mirrored by the layers of birds - few to many, sharp to soft focus.  I''d crop a bit off the bottom. 9</td>', 'Ok - I would be startled by a flock of seagulls busting into the air, I''m sure I  wouldn;t have the presence of mind to get such a good photo.  I love the layers of color mirrored by the layers of birds - few to many, sharp to soft focus.  I''d crop a bit off the bottom. 9', '2003-11-29 12:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(498437, 48163, 7628, '<td valign="top">As ever, a quality photo from Sweden.  Gorgeously done.  Only wish would be a bit more surprise on Jonatan or Alexander''s face. 9</td>', 'As ever, a quality photo from Sweden.  Gorgeously done.  Only wish would be a bit more surprise on Jonatan or Alexander''s face. 9', '2003-11-29 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(498440, 48283, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great use of color and silhoutte. The water surface looks strange (over-saturated?), but I''m not sure how you''d fix that without spot-editing. Connection to this challenge is subtle to say the least, but the photo certainly deserves to be seen.</td>', 'Great use of color and silhoutte. The water surface looks strange (over-saturated?), but I''m not sure how you''d fix that without spot-editing. Connection to this challenge is subtle to say the least, but the photo certainly deserves to be seen.', '2003-11-29 12:06:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(498445, 48199, 7628, '<td valign="top">wonderful capture of water - how many times did your poor subject have to dry off and change clothes?  Or cold yo possibly have gotten this in one take?  The guesture o the hands is such a natural one, it doesn''t even look posed.  And perfect against the black background. teeny bit sharper maybe? 9</td>', 'wonderful capture of water - how many times did your poor subject have to dry off and change clothes?  Or cold yo possibly have gotten this in one take?  The guesture o the hands is such a natural one, it doesn''t even look posed.  And perfect against the black background. teeny bit sharper maybe? 9', '2003-11-29 12:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(498447, 48205, 7485, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition, but try as I might, I can''t figure out how this is supposed to convey a feeling of surprise</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition, but try as I might, I can''t figure out how this is supposed to convey a feeling of surprise', '2003-11-29 12:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(498449, 48202, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great composition, but too contrasty for my taste</td>', 'Great composition, but too contrasty for my taste', '2003-11-29 12:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(498450, 47747, 7628, '<td valign="top">lovely serene and tense at the same time.  great capture of a deer.  The b/w blends the deer nicely into the environment, I like how she is surrounded by the light wisps of grass and her ears are against the blurr of distant trees.  I might want to see it just a tad darker...9</td>', 'lovely serene and tense at the same time.  great capture of a deer.  The b/w blends the deer nicely into the environment, I like how she is surrounded by the light wisps of grass and her ears are against the blurr of distant trees.  I might want to see it just a tad darker...9', '2003-11-29 12:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(498628, 48199, 14623, '<td valign="top">Thats a neat idea! Well executed, the look on his face is natural.</td>', 'Thats a neat idea! Well executed, the look on his face is natural.', '2003-11-29 17:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(498629, 47791, 14623, '<td valign="top">Would''ve looked better without the fingers, and without any other balloons imho</td>', 'Would''ve looked better without the fingers, and without any other balloons imho', '2003-11-29 17:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(498630, 48308, 14623, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression on the child''s face. But too blurry, red-eye!?</td>', 'Wonderful expression on the child''s face. But too blurry, red-eye!?', '2003-11-29 17:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(498631, 48234, 14623, '<td valign="top">How about the finger shown in a recoiling motion?</td>', 'How about the finger shown in a recoiling motion?', '2003-11-29 17:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(498711, 48163, 3032, '<td valign="top">Judging on the border and the boy that is portrayed I''d guess this is a photo from Carsten. :)<br/>Reminds me of an encouter with a dragonfly during a stay in Kalmar. Instead of sitting on my forehead is sat on my toes. As I lay on my back, my expression must have been about the same and so was my age at that time. :)<br/>Excellent DOF (the eyes as main focus), composition and greyscale toning. I do wonder if that is real butterfly there.</td>', 'Judging on the border and the boy that is portrayed I''d guess this is a photo from Carsten. :)Reminds me of an encouter with a dragonfly during a stay in Kalmar. Instead of sitting on my forehead is sat on my toes. As I lay on my back, my expression must have been about the same and so was my age at that time. :)Excellent DOF (the eyes as main focus), composition and greyscale toning. I do wonder if that is real butterfly there.', '2003-11-29 19:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(498773, 48138, 14553, '<td valign="top">wow, so many meanings, so many colours, one great photo! I love the natural colours the m&amp;m''s give you, nicely laid out, maybe a bit less yellow though...</td>', 'wow, so many meanings, so many colours, one great photo! I love the natural colours the m&m''s give you, nicely laid out, maybe a bit less yellow though...', '2003-11-29 21:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(498774, 48240, 14553, '<td valign="top">poor girl! she seems too focused on the photographer and not the immediate threat that looms below her....i feel the colours of her towel and that of the curtain create unwanted dissonance.....</td>', 'poor girl! she seems too focused on the photographer and not the immediate threat that looms below her....i feel the colours of her towel and that of the curtain create unwanted dissonance.....', '2003-11-29 21:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(498775, 48177, 14553, '<td valign="top">this picture not only suprised me but also the rodent and the birdmother!<br/> <br/>This has to be on the top 5 for this challenge good focus and colors</td>', 'this picture not only suprised me but also the rodent and the birdmother! This has to be on the top 5 for this challenge good focus and colors', '2003-11-29 21:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(498776, 48308, 14553, '<td valign="top">the red eye! the peach eye! the focus!</td>', 'the red eye! the peach eye! the focus!', '2003-11-29 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(498780, 48265, 14553, '<td valign="top">perfect, as far as my eyes can tell.</td>', 'perfect, as far as my eyes can tell.', '2003-11-29 22:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(498782, 48133, 14553, '<td valign="top">such a terrible suprise, a genious couldn''t have done better. perhaps though, i''m guessing this was a staged photo..lol, the box could have been cleaned up a bit more....</td>', 'such a terrible suprise, a genious couldn''t have done better. perhaps though, i''m guessing this was a staged photo..lol, the box could have been cleaned up a bit more....', '2003-11-29 22:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(498789, 48205, 14553, '<td valign="top">the desaturation of color on the hand brings the flower more to the center of my attention, good choice to leave the soil/dirt/ on the ground, draws my eyes from bottom right to top left....good job</td>', 'the desaturation of color on the hand brings the flower more to the center of my attention, good choice to leave the soil/dirt/ on the ground, draws my eyes from bottom right to top left....good job', '2003-11-29 22:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(498791, 48304, 14553, '<td valign="top">i wouldn''t have known you were hiking if you didn''t include the rest of the scenery unfortunatly the rest of the scenery destracted me from the powerlines......too much going on in the photo.</td>', 'i wouldn''t have known you were hiking if you didn''t include the rest of the scenery unfortunatly the rest of the scenery destracted me from the powerlines......too much going on in the photo.', '2003-11-29 22:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
