(499059, 48220, 8953, '<td valign="top">What a neat idea! When first I looked at this image I do not think I gave it thought it deserved. Your use of light and the classic red and gold of the present and bow, put things together well. maybe a little more rotation of the package to give just one more dimension...Like when taking a picture of a building and creating perspective? I''m bumping this shot. Good luck!</td>', 'What a neat idea! When first I looked at this image I do not think I gave it thought it deserved. Your use of light and the classic red and gold of the present and bow, put things together well. maybe a little more rotation of the package to give just one more dimension...Like when taking a picture of a building and creating perspective? I''m bumping this shot. Good luck!', '2003-11-30 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(499062, 48283, 8953, '<td valign="top">When a flock of birds are spooked! nice idea, I almost missed the angle on this one. the colors add so much to the mood of this shot...wonderful sun set. good luck!</td>', 'When a flock of birds are spooked! nice idea, I almost missed the angle on this one. the colors add so much to the mood of this shot...wonderful sun set. good luck!', '2003-11-30 11:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(499063, 48215, 8953, '<td valign="top">Taking a good shot of an animal can be a bit tricky. would have had a great deal more impact for me if the dog seemed in to it as well. The lighting works, as does the festive feeling of the ribbon...has a portrait feel to it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-01 00:16:50.</i></td>', 'Taking a good shot of an animal can be a bit tricky. would have had a great deal more impact for me if the dog seemed in to it as well. The lighting works, as does the festive feeling of the ribbon...has a portrait feel to it.', '2003-11-30 11:38:12.000000', '2003-12-01 00:16:50.000000', 1),
(499065, 48161, 8953, '<td valign="top">The young and the brave:) Kids reactions can be such fun...knowing that the young man would love to jump back but wanting to show his strengh at not being surprised!</td>', 'The young and the brave:) Kids reactions can be such fun...knowing that the young man would love to jump back but wanting to show his strengh at not being surprised!', '2003-11-30 11:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(499067, 48173, 8953, '<td valign="top">the premise is good. a bit staged (but of course most in this challenge are). The lighting is super and your color saturation is good. The angle of the cut also helps this image...I wonder if the feel of balance might have worked more if reversed?</td>', 'the premise is good. a bit staged (but of course most in this challenge are). The lighting is super and your color saturation is good. The angle of the cut also helps this image...I wonder if the feel of balance might have worked more if reversed?', '2003-11-30 11:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(499070, 48173, 12253, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, though I personally don''t think this was the point of the surprise challenge. A bit overexposed on the apple; some oversharpening noticealble by the stem; Also, as a special effect, the apple isn''t integrated well enough to cause any surprise.</td>', 'Cute idea, though I personally don''t think this was the point of the surprise challenge. A bit overexposed on the apple; some oversharpening noticealble by the stem; Also, as a special effect, the apple isn''t integrated well enough to cause any surprise.', '2003-11-30 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(499071, 48304, 8953, '<td valign="top">I get the idea of what you were trying to convey:) but the image seems to be relying to much on the title. Would this image have worked better if the power lines were more the fore front? a bit more saturation as well for deeper greens... a greater contrast. would like to know where this is:) Hope this helped, good luck.</td>', 'I get the idea of what you were trying to convey:) but the image seems to be relying to much on the title. Would this image have worked better if the power lines were more the fore front? a bit more saturation as well for deeper greens... a greater contrast. would like to know where this is:) Hope this helped, good luck.', '2003-11-30 11:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(499076, 48126, 12253, '<td valign="top">What surprises you about this?  Cookies are snarfed all the time if you leave them out on  a paper towel.  Anyway, the paper towel doesn make a good backdrop here.  And I am afraid I personally don''t think this is the essense of what was asked for in surprise.  I am curious though how you did this within the rules!  You got pretty good shadow detail here.</td>', 'What surprises you about this?  Cookies are snarfed all the time if you leave them out on  a paper towel.  Anyway, the paper towel doesn make a good backdrop here.  And I am afraid I personally don''t think this is the essense of what was asked for in surprise.  I am curious though how you did this within the rules!  You got pretty good shadow detail here.', '2003-11-30 11:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(499079, 48283, 12253, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot; I would have liked to see the crop of just the birds sillouetted against the sky.  The color contrast there is very cool, though perhaps a bit too dark a levels job here.  <br/> <br/>However, I am not sure I see the connection to the challenge here.</td>', 'An interesting shot; I would have liked to see the crop of just the birds sillouetted against the sky.  The color contrast there is very cool, though perhaps a bit too dark a levels job here.   However, I am not sure I see the connection to the challenge here.', '2003-11-30 11:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(499082, 47437, 8953, '<td valign="top">A snap shot style entry...tough to get a good feel of art or stock from this. No question of the surprise of a birthday present (or whatever celebration is at hand).  Might have taken this shot and either rotated CCW about 4 degrees for balance...or rotated CW 30 degrees...for a more impact!  Hope this helped:) good luck.</td>', 'A snap shot style entry...tough to get a good feel of art or stock from this. No question of the surprise of a birthday present (or whatever celebration is at hand).  Might have taken this shot and either rotated CCW about 4 degrees for balance...or rotated CW 30 degrees...for a more impact!  Hope this helped:) good luck.', '2003-11-30 11:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(499083, 48133, 12253, '<td valign="top">A difficult capture because of the velvet; unfortunately, it is too dark there, and you can''t even see the slot for the ring.  I would have liked to see the skin tones evened out here for aesthetic effect, e.g., with Neat Image, though I realize they are natural for a closeup like this.<br/> <br/>Personally, this is not my interpretation of the challenge.  I understand how some people think that, but I feel it was the "easiest way out" in a difficult challenge.</td>', 'A difficult capture because of the velvet; unfortunately, it is too dark there, and you can''t even see the slot for the ring.  I would have liked to see the skin tones evened out here for aesthetic effect, e.g., with Neat Image, though I realize they are natural for a closeup like this. Personally, this is not my interpretation of the challenge.  I understand how some people think that, but I feel it was the "easiest way out" in a difficult challenge.', '2003-11-30 11:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(499085, 48203, 8953, '<td valign="top">Lovely Model:) great expression...does say suprise...I wish the background were different. Either one of more depth...like a resturant? or a park? or just droped out completely like the night or the sky. hope this helped. Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely Model:) great expression...does say suprise...I wish the background were different. Either one of more depth...like a resturant? or a park? or just droped out completely like the night or the sky. hope this helped. Good luck!', '2003-11-30 12:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(499087, 48295, 8953, '<td valign="top">Not a good day! A fun shot. the small bit of her head in the upper left corner of the shot is distracting. would have liked a bit more saturation.</td>', 'Not a good day! A fun shot. the small bit of her head in the upper left corner of the shot is distracting. would have liked a bit more saturation.', '2003-11-30 12:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(499088, 48250, 8953, '<td valign="top">I almost missed the the fact someone is about to get a rude awakening:) Kids! You gotta love em:) Nice action shot...but so much going on behind the young man, you almost miss the true premise of the shot.could this have been taken from another angle? one with less distractions. hope this helped, good luck!</td>', 'I almost missed the the fact someone is about to get a rude awakening:) Kids! You gotta love em:) Nice action shot...but so much going on behind the young man, you almost miss the true premise of the shot.could this have been taken from another angle? one with less distractions. hope this helped, good luck!', '2003-11-30 12:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(499089, 48133, 8953, '<td valign="top">I believe this shot may have worked even better without the title...or a much shorter one...like say..."Ring?" well done crop and angle though and good use of B&amp;W. Good Luck!</td>', 'I believe this shot may have worked even better without the title...or a much shorter one...like say..."Ring?" well done crop and angle though and good use of B&W. Good Luck!', '2003-11-30 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(499091, 48281, 8953, '<td valign="top">Very!! Shocking!! now lets talk abot the image:) when using a constant background even the littlest items can distract...like the speck just to the left of the ring. also the shadow cast from the light source is way to strong...maybe a second to camera left would have helped balance the light...hope this helped:) good luck!</td>', 'Very!! Shocking!! now lets talk abot the image:) when using a constant background even the littlest items can distract...like the speck just to the left of the ring. also the shadow cast from the light source is way to strong...maybe a second to camera left would have helped balance the light...hope this helped:) good luck!', '2003-11-30 12:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(499095, 48207, 8953, '<td valign="top">You are making this one tough to get...at least for me:( I see some things in this image that help to find surprise...like what might be in the woods? If you would like more of a critique on the image...I will be happy to, just email:) good luck.</td>', 'You are making this one tough to get...at least for me:( I see some things in this image that help to find surprise...like what might be in the woods? If you would like more of a critique on the image...I will be happy to, just email:) good luck.', '2003-11-30 12:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(499146, 48144, 12253, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if she isacting or not, so that''s very good.  The expression is right. The photo is generally well done too, though I wish you had a bit more at the top and the light blue object in the background were''nt there.</td>', 'I can''t tell if she isacting or not, so that''s very good.  The expression is right. The photo is generally well done too, though I wish you had a bit more at the top and the light blue object in the background were''nt there.', '2003-11-30 13:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(499150, 48295, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is very funny; though staged, it''s one of the best surprise scenes.  I think it might have been better cropped a little at the left, and had a tad more sharpness.  If you had someone there to help, some fill light on your face would have really emphasized the surprise!  Good sense of humor.  Now we want to see the bald shot! ;)</td>', 'This is very funny; though staged, it''s one of the best surprise scenes.  I think it might have been better cropped a little at the left, and had a tad more sharpness.  If you had someone there to help, some fill light on your face would have really emphasized the surprise!  Good sense of humor.  Now we want to see the bald shot! ;)', '2003-11-30 13:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(499152, 48284, 12253, '<td valign="top">A gpod set up and generally well done!  I think it might have been good to be a little more subtle than the sign in the background.  A small investment in a hallmark birthday card, laying on the table.  And the pregnancy kit placed more "naturally" on the table.  Finally, a position with ajust a little more face towards the camera.  But these are just for feedback, I do like the idea and shot.</td>', 'A gpod set up and generally well done!  I think it might have been good to be a little more subtle than the sign in the background.  A small investment in a hallmark birthday card, laying on the table.  And the pregnancy kit placed more "naturally" on the table.  Finally, a position with ajust a little more face towards the camera.  But these are just for feedback, I do like the idea and shot.', '2003-11-30 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
