(499300, 48117, 8860, '<td valign="top">Time to call the exorcist!  ; )<br/> <br/>Nice idea - crisp shot too, with clear lighting.</td>', 'Time to call the exorcist!  ; ) Nice idea - crisp shot too, with clear lighting.', '2003-11-30 17:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
