(499535, 48316, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good expression and idea.  Seems to have a lot of noise making the image look a little lower quality than it should.  Also, I would have considered moving her farther from the wall.</td>', 'Good expression and idea.  Seems to have a lot of noise making the image look a little lower quality than it should.  Also, I would have considered moving her farther from the wall.', '2003-11-30 23:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(499536, 48308, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good expression.  A shame that the editing rules wouldn''t let you get rid of the red eye.  I think I would have considered cropping the right and putting her on the right 1/3 of the frame.</td>', 'Good expression.  A shame that the editing rules wouldn''t let you get rid of the red eye.  I think I would have considered cropping the right and putting her on the right 1/3 of the frame.', '2003-11-30 23:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
