(506452, 48161, 12902, '<td valign="top">Greetings from The Critique Club,<br/> <br/>A wonderful, fun and imaginative family shot. I think this is beautifully done! The expressions are perfect, the toning is perfect. Your composition is excellent. Very good choice of angle and point of view too. The expressions of the kids make this photo well fit for this challenge. I like the way you caught the flight of the pigeons. It is a happy moment and the whole photo shows it. Pitty that the cars in the background, the pole and the chains are so distracting. But you came very close to a perfect shot. Keep it up... it looks like you are getting better and better.<br/> <br/>Best regards,<br/> Elena<br/></td>', 'Greetings from The Critique Club, A wonderful, fun and imaginative family shot. I think this is beautifully done! The expressions are perfect, the toning is perfect. Your composition is excellent. Very good choice of angle and point of view too. The expressions of the kids make this photo well fit for this challenge. I like the way you caught the flight of the pigeons. It is a happy moment and the whole photo shows it. Pitty that the cars in the background, the pole and the chains are so distracting. But you came very close to a perfect shot. Keep it up... it looks like you are getting better and better. Best regards, Elena', '2003-12-08 04:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
