(1101979, 48316, 13113, '<td valign="top">This is my cat and I like it very much too! I like it too much. I think that it is a little blury on the cat''s leg but hey I was there when you took it and he was moving. The way that you caught the cat''s face was good because he looks like what he is saying! CUTE! I think that you deserve a higher place!</td>', 'This is my cat and I like it very much too! I like it too much. I think that it is a little blury on the cat''s leg but hey I was there when you took it and he was moving. The way that you caught the cat''s face was good because he looks like what he is saying! CUTE! I think that you deserve a higher place!', '2005-01-11 17:03:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1447859, 48203, 368, '<td valign="top">i honestly dont like the expression on the medel''s face .. speficially within her mouth area .. looks odd ... and it looks like the focused part of the photo is capturing the wall more than the model .. see the top of the model''s hair ... overall i like the concept .. i think it may have worked better in a less staged atmosphere</td>', 'i honestly dont like the expression on the medel''s face .. speficially within her mouth area .. looks odd ... and it looks like the focused part of the photo is capturing the wall more than the model .. see the top of the model''s hair ... overall i like the concept .. i think it may have worked better in a less staged atmosphere', '2005-06-11 17:28:04.000000', NULL, 0),
